window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":14,"en":"Media, Misinformation & Communication","zh":"媒體、假訊息與傳播","items":[{"w":"journalism","pos":"n.","def":"the work of collecting and writing news","cn":"新聞業；新聞工作","s":"My cousin studied ________ at university, and now she writes stories about local problems for an online newspaper.","zh":"我的表姊在大學主修新聞學，現在她為一家線上報紙撰寫關於地方問題的報導。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A1","t":"新聞學"},{"w":"journalist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who writes or reports the news","cn":"記者；新聞工作者","s":"The ________ waited outside the hospital for hours, but the doctors refused to answer any of her questions.","zh":"那位記者在醫院外等了好幾個小時，但醫生們拒絕回答她的任何問題。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A2","t":"記者"},{"w":"reporter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who finds and tells news stories","cn":"記者；採訪員","s":"A young ________ was sent to cover the typhoon, so he stood in the rain and described the damage on live TV.","zh":"一位年輕的記者被派去報導颱風，所以他站在雨中，在電視直播上描述災情。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A3","t":"記者"},{"w":"correspondent","pos":"n.","def":"a journalist who reports from a particular place or topic","cn":"特派員；通訊記者","s":"The BBC's ________ in Tokyo has lived in Japan for ten years, so she understands the local culture very well.","zh":"英國廣播公司駐東京的特派員已經在日本住了十年，所以她非常了解當地文化。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A4","t":"特派員"},{"w":"editor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who checks and decides what is published","cn":"編輯；主編","s":"The ________ asked me to cut my article from 1,000 words to 600, because there was not enough space on the page.","zh":"編輯要求我把文章從一千字刪到六百字，因為版面上沒有足夠的空間。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A5","t":"編輯"},{"w":"editorial","pos":"n.","def":"a newspaper article giving the paper's opinion","cn":"社論","s":"Today's ________ criticises the government's new housing plan, and many readers have written letters to agree with it.","zh":"今天的社論批評政府的新住宅計畫，而許多讀者寫信表示贊同。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A6","t":"社論"},{"w":"headline","pos":"n.","def":"the title of a news story in large letters","cn":"新聞標題；頭條","s":"The ________ said that prices would double, but when I read the whole article, the real increase was only five percent.","zh":"那則標題說價格會翻倍，但當我讀完整篇文章時，實際漲幅只有百分之五。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A7","t":"標題"},{"w":"front page","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first page of a newspaper with the main news","cn":"頭版","s":"The photo of the flooded village appeared on the ______ ______ of every newspaper, so the whole country saw it the next morning.","zh":"那張被淹沒村莊的照片出現在每份報紙的頭版上，所以隔天早上全國的人都看到了。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A8","t":"頭版"},{"w":"newspaper","pos":"n.","def":"printed pages of news published daily or weekly","cn":"報紙","s":"My grandfather still buys a paper ________ every morning, although most of his friends now read the news on their phones.","zh":"我爺爺每天早上仍然買一份紙本報紙，儘管他大部分朋友現在都用手機看新聞。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A9","t":"報紙"},{"w":"newsroom","pos":"n.","def":"the office where journalists prepare the news","cn":"新聞編輯室","s":"The ________ was very busy on election night, and nobody went home until all the results had been reported.","zh":"選舉當晚新聞編輯室非常忙碌，直到所有結果都報導完之前沒有人回家。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A10","t":"新聞編輯室"},{"w":"press conference","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a meeting where someone answers reporters' questions","cn":"記者會","s":"The mayor held a ______ ______ after the fire, but he left quickly because reporters kept asking difficult questions.","zh":"市長在火災後召開了記者會，但他很快就離開了，因為記者們一直問困難的問題。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A11","t":"記者會"},{"w":"press release","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an official statement given to journalists","cn":"新聞稿","s":"The company sent out a ______ ______ about its new phone, and dozens of websites copied the text without checking it.","zh":"那家公司發布了一份關於新手機的新聞稿，而幾十個網站沒有查證就照抄了內容。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A12","t":"新聞稿"},{"w":"scoop","pos":"n.","def":"an important story one newspaper reports first","cn":"獨家新聞","s":"The student newspaper got a big ________ when it discovered the school's budget problems, and even national TV reported it later.","zh":"學生報發現學校的預算問題時拿到了一則大獨家新聞，後來連全國電視台都報導了。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A13","t":"獨家新聞"},{"w":"exclusive","pos":"adj.","def":"only given to one news company","cn":"獨家的","s":"The singer gave an ________ interview to one magazine, so fans had to buy that magazine to read about her new album.","zh":"那位歌手只接受一家雜誌的獨家專訪，所以粉絲必須買那本雜誌才能讀到她新專輯的消息。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A14","t":"獨家"},{"w":"byline","pos":"n.","def":"the line that shows who wrote an article","cn":"署名欄（作者署名）","s":"I was very proud to see my name in the ________ of the school magazine, because it was my first published article.","zh":"看到我的名字出現在校刊的署名欄上，我非常驕傲，因為那是我第一篇刊出的文章。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A15","t":"署名欄"},{"w":"columnist","pos":"n.","def":"a writer who regularly writes opinion pieces","cn":"專欄作家","s":"The ________ writes about family life every Sunday, and many parents say her funny stories make them feel less alone.","zh":"那位專欄作家每個星期日寫關於家庭生活的文章，許多父母說她有趣的故事讓他們覺得不那麼孤單。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A16","t":"專欄作家"},{"w":"op-ed","pos":"n.","def":"an opinion article written by someone outside the newspaper","cn":"特約評論；投書","s":"A doctor wrote an ________ about the dangers of vaping, and the newspaper published it because many teenagers are affected.","zh":"一位醫生寫了一篇關於電子菸危害的投書，報社刊登了它，因為許多青少年受到影響。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A17","t":"投書"},{"w":"tabloid","pos":"n.","def":"a popular newspaper with short, exciting stories about famous people","cn":"小報；八卦報","s":"The ________ printed a shocking story about the actor's private life, but later it had to admit that the story was false.","zh":"那份小報刊登了一則關於那位演員私生活的驚人報導，但後來不得不承認那則報導是假的。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A18","t":"小報"},{"w":"newsworthy","pos":"adj.","def":"interesting or important enough to report","cn":"有新聞價值的","s":"The editor said that a cat stuck in a tree was not ________, but the story became popular online anyway.","zh":"編輯說一隻卡在樹上的貓沒有新聞價值，但這則故事還是在網路上爆紅了。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A19","t":"新聞價值"},{"w":"breaking news","pos":"n.phr.","def":"news about something that is happening right now","cn":"即時新聞；快訊","s":"We were watching a cooking show when ______ ______ about the earthquake interrupted the programme, so everyone stopped and listened.","zh":"我們正在看烹飪節目時，關於地震的即時新聞打斷了節目，所以大家都停下來聆聽。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A20","t":"即時新聞"},{"w":"investigative","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to find hidden facts","cn":"調查性的","s":"The ________ report took six months to complete, but it finally showed how the factory had been polluting the river.","zh":"那篇調查報導花了六個月才完成，但最終揭露了工廠是如何汙染河流的。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A21","t":"調查"},{"w":"whistle-blower","pos":"n.","def":"a person who tells the public about wrongdoing at work","cn":"吹哨者；揭弊者","s":"The ________ lost her job after she reported the company's illegal dumping, but she said she did not regret telling the truth.","zh":"那位吹哨者揭發公司非法傾倒廢棄物後丟了工作，但她說她不後悔說出真相。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A22","t":"吹哨者"},{"w":"informant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who gives secret information to someone","cn":"線人；消息提供者","s":"The journalist promised never to reveal the name of her ________, because he could lose his job if people found out.","zh":"那名記者承諾絕不透露她線人的名字，因為如果別人發現，他可能會丟掉工作。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A23","t":"線人"},{"w":"eyewitness","pos":"n.","def":"a person who saw an event happen","cn":"目擊者","s":"An ________ told reporters that the car was driving very fast, and her description helped the police understand the accident.","zh":"一位目擊者告訴記者那輛車開得非常快，而她的描述幫助警方了解這起事故。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A24","t":"目擊者"},{"w":"paparazzi","pos":"n.","def":"photographers who follow famous people to take pictures","cn":"狗仔隊","s":"The ________ waited outside the restaurant all evening, so the famous couple had to leave through the kitchen door.","zh":"狗仔隊整晚守在餐廳外面，所以那對名人夫妻只好從廚房的門離開。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A25","t":"狗仔隊"},{"w":"obituary","pos":"n.","def":"a news article about a person who has recently died","cn":"訃聞","s":"The local paper published an ________ for the old teacher, and many former students shared it online with kind memories.","zh":"地方報紙為那位老教師刊登了一則訃聞，許多以前的學生在網路上分享並寫下溫馨的回憶。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A26","t":"訃聞"},{"w":"news outlet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a company or website that publishes news","cn":"新聞媒體；新聞管道","s":"Several ______ ______ reported the same false story, because they all copied it from one social media post without checking.","zh":"好幾家新聞媒體報導了同一則假新聞，因為它們都沒有查證就從一則社群貼文抄來。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A27","t":"新聞媒體"},{"w":"press freedom","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the right of the media to report without government control","cn":"新聞自由","s":"Taiwan ranks highly for ______ ______, so journalists here can criticise the government without fear of going to prison.","zh":"台灣的新聞自由排名很高，所以這裡的記者可以批評政府而不必擔心坐牢。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A28","t":"新聞自由"},{"w":"paywall","pos":"n.","def":"a system that makes you pay to read online articles","cn":"付費牆","s":"I wanted to read the full article, but it was behind a ________, so I only saw the first two paragraphs.","zh":"我想讀完整篇文章，但它被放在付費牆後面，所以我只看到前兩段。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A29","t":"付費牆"},{"w":"sensational","pos":"adj.","def":"made to shock or excite people rather than inform them","cn":"聳動的；譁眾取寵的","s":"The website uses ________ headlines to attract clicks, but the articles themselves usually contain very little real information.","zh":"那個網站使用聳動的標題來吸引點擊，但文章本身通常只有很少的真實資訊。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A30","t":"聳動的"},{"w":"censor","pos":"v.","def":"to remove parts of news, books or films that authorities dislike","cn":"審查；刪減","s":"The government ________ the documentary before it was shown, so viewers never saw the scenes of the protest.","zh":"政府在紀錄片播出前就審查刪剪了它，所以觀眾從未看到抗議的畫面。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A31","t":"審查刪剪"},{"w":"censorship","pos":"n.","def":"the control of what people can say, read or watch","cn":"審查制度","s":"Strict ________ means that some citizens cannot use foreign websites, so they often rely on VPNs to read international news.","zh":"嚴格的審查制度意味著有些公民無法使用外國網站，所以他們常依靠 VPN 來閱讀國際新聞。","part":"A","sec":"News & Journalism 新聞與新聞業","lab":"A32","t":"審查制度"},{"w":"broadcast","pos":"v.","def":"to send out a programme on TV or radio","cn":"播出；廣播","s":"The final match was ________ live on national television, so millions of people watched it at home and in restaurants.","zh":"那場決賽在全國電視台現場播出，所以數百萬人在家裡和餐廳收看。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A33","t":"播出"},{"w":"broadcaster","pos":"n.","def":"a company or person that makes TV or radio programmes","cn":"廣播公司；播報員","s":"The public ________ does not show adverts, because it is paid for by taxes rather than by companies.","zh":"那家公共廣播公司不播放廣告，因為它的經費來自稅收而不是企業。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A34","t":"廣播公司"},{"w":"television","pos":"n.","def":"a system or machine for watching programmes","cn":"電視","s":"Fewer young people watch ________ in the evening now, because they prefer short videos on their phones.","zh":"現在晚上看電視的年輕人比較少了，因為他們比較喜歡在手機上看短影片。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A35","t":"電視"},{"w":"programme","pos":"n.","def":"a show on TV or radio","cn":"節目","s":"My favourite ________ is a science show for teenagers, and each episode explains one strange fact about nature.","zh":"我最喜歡的節目是一個給青少年看的科學節目，每一集都解釋一個關於大自然的奇特事實。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A36","t":"節目"},{"w":"documentary","pos":"n.","def":"a film or programme that gives facts about a real topic","cn":"紀錄片","s":"We watched a ________ about plastic in the ocean, and afterwards the whole class decided to stop using plastic straws.","zh":"我們看了一部關於海洋塑膠的紀錄片，之後全班決定不再使用塑膠吸管。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A37","t":"紀錄片"},{"w":"talk show","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a programme where a host chats with guests","cn":"脫口秀；談話節目","s":"The actor appeared on a late-night ______ ______, and he told funny stories about the mistakes he made while filming.","zh":"那位演員上了一個深夜談話節目，他講了一些拍片時犯錯的趣事。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A38","t":"談話節目"},{"w":"sitcom","pos":"n.","def":"a funny TV series about the same characters","cn":"情境喜劇","s":"My parents love an old American ________ about six friends in New York, so they watch the episodes again and again.","zh":"我爸媽很喜歡一部關於紐約六個朋友的老美國情境喜劇，所以他們一再重看那些集數。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A39","t":"情境喜劇"},{"w":"soap opera","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a long-running drama series about people's lives","cn":"肥皂劇；連續劇","s":"My grandmother never misses her favourite ______ ______, and she gets very upset when the characters argue or fall in love.","zh":"我奶奶從不錯過她最愛的連續劇，而且劇中人物吵架或談戀愛時她都會很激動。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A40","t":"連續劇"},{"w":"reality show","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a programme that films ordinary people in real situations","cn":"真人實境秀","s":"The ______ ______ claims to show real life, but some contestants later admitted that many scenes had been planned in advance.","zh":"那個真人實境秀聲稱呈現真實生活，但有些參賽者後來承認許多場景是事先安排好的。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A41","t":"真人實境秀"},{"w":"viewer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who watches TV or videos","cn":"觀眾","s":"Many ________ complained about the violent scenes, so the channel moved the programme to a later time.","zh":"許多觀眾抱怨那些暴力場面，所以電視台把節目移到較晚的時段。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A42","t":"觀眾"},{"w":"audience","pos":"n.","def":"the people who watch, read or listen to something","cn":"觀眾；聽眾；受眾","s":"The speaker made a joke at the beginning, and the whole ________ laughed, so she felt much more relaxed.","zh":"講者在一開始開了個玩笑，全場聽眾都笑了，所以她感覺放鬆多了。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A43","t":"聽眾"},{"w":"ratings","pos":"n.","def":"numbers showing how many people watch a programme","cn":"收視率","s":"The show's ________ fell sharply after the main actor left, so the network decided to cancel it.","zh":"那位主角離開後，節目的收視率急劇下滑，所以電視網決定停播。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A44","t":"收視率"},{"w":"prime time","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the evening hours when most people watch TV","cn":"黃金時段","s":"Adverts shown during ______ ______ are very expensive, because that is when the largest number of families are watching.","zh":"在黃金時段播出的廣告非常昂貴，因為那時收看的家庭最多。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A45","t":"黃金時段"},{"w":"commercial break","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a pause in a programme for adverts","cn":"廣告時間；進廣告","s":"During the ______ ______ I quickly made some tea, but I missed the start of the next part of the film.","zh":"廣告時間的時候我很快泡了杯茶，但我錯過了電影下一段的開頭。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A46","t":"廣告時間"},{"w":"host","pos":"n.","def":"the person who introduces a show and talks to guests","cn":"主持人","s":"The ________ of the quiz show was friendly and calm, so even nervous contestants were able to answer well.","zh":"那個益智節目的主持人友善又沉穩，所以連緊張的參賽者都能回答得很好。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A47","t":"主持人"},{"w":"presenter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who introduces a TV or radio programme","cn":"節目主持人；主播","s":"The weather ________ pointed to the map and warned that heavy rain would arrive by the weekend, so people prepared early.","zh":"氣象主播指著地圖警告大雨將在週末前到來，所以民眾提早做好準備。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A48","t":"主播"},{"w":"newsreader","pos":"n.","def":"a person who reads the news on TV or radio","cn":"新聞播報員；主播","s":"The ________ stayed calm while she reported the disaster, but viewers could see that she was deeply affected.","zh":"那位新聞主播報導災難時保持冷靜，但觀眾看得出她深受影響。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A49","t":"新聞主播"},{"w":"episode","pos":"n.","def":"one part of a TV or radio series","cn":"（一）集","s":"The last ________ of the series ended with a big surprise, and fans have been discussing it online ever since.","zh":"那部影集的最後一集以一個大驚喜收尾，粉絲們從那時起就一直在網路上討論。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A50","t":"集"},{"w":"studio","pos":"n.","def":"a room where TV, radio or music is recorded","cn":"攝影棚；錄音室","s":"We visited a TV ________ on our school trip, and we were surprised by how small the set looked in real life.","zh":"我們校外教學參觀了一間電視攝影棚，我們很驚訝實際上的布景看起來那麼小。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A51","t":"攝影棚"},{"w":"podcast","pos":"n.","def":"a recorded audio programme you can download or stream","cn":"播客；Podcast節目","s":"I listen to an English ________ on the bus every morning, and it has really improved my listening skills.","zh":"我每天早上在公車上聽一個英文播客節目，它真的提升了我的聽力。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A52","t":"播客節目"},{"w":"airwaves","pos":"n.","def":"the radio signals used for broadcasting","cn":"廣播電波；廣播節目","s":"The song was all over the ________ that summer, so you could hear it in shops, taxis and almost every café.","zh":"那年夏天那首歌充斥廣播電台，所以在商店、計程車和幾乎每家咖啡廳都聽得到。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A53","t":"廣播電台"},{"w":"newscast","pos":"n.","def":"a news programme on TV or radio","cn":"新聞報導節目","s":"My parents watch the evening ________ every day at seven, and they always discuss the main stories during dinner.","zh":"晚間新聞節目是我爸媽每天七點必看的，晚餐時他們總是討論其中的主要新聞。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A54","t":"晚間新聞節目"},{"w":"on-demand","pos":"adj.","def":"available whenever you want it","cn":"隨選的","s":"The ________ service lets you watch shows whenever you like, so you no longer need to wait for a fixed time.","zh":"這個隨選服務讓你隨時想看就看，所以你不再需要等固定的時段。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A55","t":"隨選"},{"w":"magazine","pos":"n.","def":"a thin weekly or monthly publication with articles and pictures","cn":"雜誌","s":"She bought a science ________ at the airport, and the article about space travel kept her busy during the long flight.","zh":"她在機場買了一本科學雜誌，那篇關於太空旅行的文章讓她在漫長的航程中不無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A56","t":"雜誌"},{"w":"edition","pos":"n.","def":"one printed version of a newspaper, book or magazine","cn":"版；版本；期","s":"The morning ________ of the paper had already been printed, so the late news about the election appeared online first.","zh":"報紙的早報版已經印好了，所以選舉的最新消息先出現在網路上。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A57","t":"版"},{"w":"print media","pos":"n.phr.","def":"newspapers and magazines printed on paper","cn":"平面媒體","s":"______ ______ has lost many readers to the internet, but some people still trust printed newspapers more than websites.","zh":"平面媒體已經因網路流失了許多讀者，但有些人仍然比較相信紙本報紙而不是網站。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A58","t":"平面媒體"},{"w":"mass media","pos":"n.phr.","def":"TV, radio and newspapers that reach large numbers of people","cn":"大眾傳播媒體","s":"The ______ ______ can shape public opinion quickly, so it has a responsibility to report facts carefully.","zh":"大眾傳媒能迅速塑造輿論，所以它有責任謹慎地報導事實。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A59","t":"大眾傳媒"},{"w":"subtitle","pos":"n.","def":"words at the bottom of the screen translating speech","cn":"字幕","s":"I watch Korean dramas with English ________, because it helps me learn new words while I enjoy the story.","zh":"我看韓劇時開英文字幕，因為這能幫助我在享受劇情的同時學新單字。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A60","t":"字幕"},{"w":"listener","pos":"n.","def":"a person who listens to a radio programme","cn":"聽眾","s":"One ________ called the radio station to share her story, and the host thanked her for being so honest.","zh":"一位聽眾打電話到電台分享她的故事，主持人感謝她如此坦誠。","part":"A","sec":"Broadcasting & Traditional Media 廣播與傳統媒體","lab":"A61","t":"聽眾"},{"w":"social media","pos":"n.phr.","def":"websites and apps where people share content and talk","cn":"社群媒體","s":"Most teenagers get their news from ______ ______, but they do not always check whether the stories are true.","zh":"大多數青少年從社群媒體獲得新聞，但他們不一定會查證那些報導是否屬實。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A62","t":"社群媒體"},{"w":"post","pos":"v.","def":"to put a message or picture online","cn":"發布；張貼（貼文）","s":"She ________ a photo of her lunch every day, and her friends always leave funny comments under it.","zh":"她每天發布一張午餐照片，而她的朋友總是在下面留些好笑的留言。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A63","t":"發布"},{"w":"repost","pos":"v.","def":"to share someone else's post again","cn":"轉發；轉貼","s":"Thousands of people ________ the video of the lost dog, so its owner found it within a few hours.","zh":"數千人轉發了那段走失狗狗的影片，所以牠的主人在幾小時內就找到了牠。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A64","t":"轉發"},{"w":"follower","pos":"n.","def":"a person who chooses to see someone's posts","cn":"追蹤者；粉絲","s":"The baker has over 50,000 ________ online, so new customers visit his shop from all over the city.","zh":"那位麵包師傅在網路上有超過五萬名追蹤者，所以全市各地都有新客人來他的店。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A65","t":"追蹤者"},{"w":"influencer","pos":"n.","def":"a person with many online followers who affects what they buy","cn":"網紅；意見領袖","s":"The ________ was paid to recommend the face cream, but she did not tell her followers that it was an advert.","zh":"那位網紅拿錢推薦那款面霜，但她沒有告訴追蹤者那是廣告。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A66","t":"網紅"},{"w":"vlogger","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes video blogs","cn":"影音部落客；Vlogger","s":"The travel ________ films every meal and every hotel room, and his videos have made a small town in Taiwan famous.","zh":"那位旅遊影音部落客拍下每一餐和每一間飯店房間，而他的影片讓台灣一個小鎮出了名。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A67","t":"影音部落客"},{"w":"blogger","pos":"n.","def":"a person who writes an online journal","cn":"部落客","s":"The food ________ gave the restaurant a bad review, so the owner invited her back to try the new menu.","zh":"那位美食部落客給那家餐廳負評，所以老闆邀請她再來試試新菜單。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A68","t":"部落客"},{"w":"hashtag","pos":"n.","def":"a word after the # sign used to group posts","cn":"主題標籤；#標籤","s":"People used the same ________ to share photos of the clean-up, so it was easy to see how many beaches had been cleared.","zh":"人們用同一個主題標籤分享淨灘照片，所以很容易看出有多少海灘被清理乾淨了。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A69","t":"主題標籤"},{"w":"viral","pos":"adj.","def":"spread very quickly to many people online","cn":"爆紅的；病毒式傳播的","s":"A video of a cat playing the piano went ________ overnight, and the owner was soon invited onto several TV shows.","zh":"一段貓彈鋼琴的影片一夜之間爆紅，主人很快就被邀請上好幾個電視節目。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A70","t":"爆紅"},{"w":"meme","pos":"n.","def":"a funny image or text copied and shared online","cn":"迷因；梗圖","s":"My brother sent me a ________ about exams, and it was so true that I laughed while I was studying.","zh":"我哥傳給我一張關於考試的梗圖，內容太真實了，害我讀書時笑出來。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A71","t":"梗圖"},{"w":"emoji","pos":"n.","def":"a small picture used in digital messages","cn":"表情符號","s":"She replied with a smiling ________, but I could not tell whether she was happy or just being polite.","zh":"她回了一個微笑的表情符號，但我分辨不出她是開心還是只是出於禮貌。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A72","t":"表情符號"},{"w":"selfie","pos":"n.","def":"a photo you take of yourself","cn":"自拍照","s":"Tourists were taking ________ at the edge of the cliff, so the park added a fence to keep them safe.","zh":"遊客在懸崖邊拍自拍照，所以公園加裝了圍欄保障他們的安全。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A73","t":"自拍照"},{"w":"profile","pos":"n.","def":"the page with information about a user","cn":"個人檔案；個人頁面","s":"Before the interview, the manager looked at my online ________, so I was glad that I had removed my old party photos.","zh":"面試前經理看了我的網路個人頁面，所以我很慶幸自己已經刪掉了以前的派對照片。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A74","t":"個人頁面"},{"w":"notification","pos":"n.","def":"a message on your phone telling you something new","cn":"通知","s":"My phone kept showing ________ during class, so I finally turned them off and concentrated much better.","zh":"上課時我的手機一直跳出通知，所以我終於把它們關掉，結果專心多了。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A75","t":"通知"},{"w":"livestream","pos":"v.","def":"to show video on the internet as it happens","cn":"直播","s":"The band ________ their concert for fans who could not buy tickets, and over a million people watched online.","zh":"那個樂團為買不到票的粉絲直播了演唱會，超過一百萬人在線上觀看。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A76","t":"直播"},{"w":"content creator","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who makes videos, posts or other online material","cn":"內容創作者","s":"Being a ______ ______ looks easy, but many spend hours filming and editing a video that lasts only one minute.","zh":"當內容創作者看似簡單，但許多人要花好幾小時拍攝和剪輯一部只有一分鐘的影片。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A77","t":"內容創作者"},{"w":"troll","pos":"n.","def":"a person who posts rude messages to upset others","cn":"網路酸民","s":"A ________ left nasty comments under every photo she posted, so she decided to block him and ignore his messages.","zh":"一位酸民在她發的每張照片下留惡毒留言，所以她決定封鎖他並不理會他的訊息。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A78","t":"酸民"},{"w":"cyberbullying","pos":"n.","def":"hurting or threatening someone online","cn":"網路霸凌","s":"________ can follow students home from school, because hurtful messages arrive on their phones at any time.","zh":"網路霸凌會讓學生回到家也逃不掉，因為傷人的訊息隨時都會傳到他們的手機上。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A79","t":"網路霸凌"},{"w":"echo chamber","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an online space where you only hear opinions like your own","cn":"同溫層；回音室","s":"If you only follow people who agree with you, you may end up in an ______ ______, and you will never hear other views.","zh":"如果你只追蹤和你意見相同的人，你可能會陷入同溫層，而且永遠聽不到其他觀點。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A80","t":"同溫層"},{"w":"filter bubble","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when apps only show you content they think you like","cn":"過濾氣泡","s":"The app keeps showing me the same kind of videos, so I worry that I am stuck in a ______ ______.","zh":"那個應用程式一直推給我同類型的影片，所以我擔心自己被困在過濾氣泡裡。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A81","t":"過濾氣泡"},{"w":"screenshot","pos":"n.","def":"a picture of what is on a screen","cn":"螢幕截圖","s":"He deleted the rude message quickly, but someone had already taken a ________, so everyone saw what he had written.","zh":"他很快就刪掉了那則無禮的訊息，但有人已經截圖了，所以大家都看到他寫了什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A82","t":"截圖"},{"w":"username","pos":"n.","def":"the name you use to log in to a website or app","cn":"使用者名稱；帳號名稱","s":"I forgot my ________ for the game, so I had to use my email address to get into my account.","zh":"我忘了那款遊戲的使用者名稱，所以必須用電子郵件地址才能登入帳號。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A83","t":"使用者名稱"},{"w":"search engine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a website that helps you find information online","cn":"搜尋引擎","s":"I typed the question into a ______ ______, but the first results were all adverts, so I scrolled down for better sources.","zh":"我把問題輸入搜尋引擎，但前幾個結果都是廣告，所以我往下滑找更好的資料來源。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A84","t":"搜尋引擎"},{"w":"website","pos":"n.","def":"a set of pages on the internet","cn":"網站","s":"The ________ looked professional, but it had no contact details, so my teacher said we should not trust it.","zh":"那個網站看起來很專業，但沒有任何聯絡資訊，所以老師說我們不應該相信它。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A85","t":"網站"},{"w":"direct message","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a private message sent on social media","cn":"私訊","s":"She sent me a ______ ______ instead of commenting publicly, because she did not want everyone to read it.","zh":"她傳私訊給我而不是公開留言，因為她不想讓大家都讀到。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A86","t":"私訊"},{"w":"group chat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an online conversation with several people at once","cn":"群組聊天","s":"Our class ______ ______ gets hundreds of messages every night, so I mute it while I am doing homework.","zh":"我們班的群組聊天每晚都有上百則訊息，所以我寫作業時會把它設為靜音。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A87","t":"群組聊天"},{"w":"unfollow","pos":"v.","def":"to stop seeing someone's posts on social media","cn":"取消追蹤","s":"I ________ that account because it kept posting angry and false stories, and now my feed feels much calmer.","zh":"我取消追蹤了那個帳號，因為它一直發布憤怒和不實的報導，現在我的動態感覺平靜多了。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A88","t":"取消追蹤"},{"w":"block","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from contacting you online","cn":"封鎖","s":"If a stranger sends you unkind messages, you should ________ the account and tell an adult you trust.","zh":"如果陌生人傳給你不友善的訊息，你應該封鎖那個帳號，並告訴你信任的大人。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A89","t":"封鎖"},{"w":"anonymity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of hiding your real name","cn":"匿名（性）","s":"________ makes some people braver online, but it also allows others to say cruel things without any consequences.","zh":"匿名性讓有些人在網路上更敢說話，但也讓另一些人說出殘忍的話而不必承擔後果。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A90","t":"匿名性"},{"w":"doomscrolling","pos":"n.","def":"reading bad news online for too long","cn":"末日滾動；狂刷負面新聞","s":"After an hour of ________ before bed, I felt anxious and could not sleep, so I now leave my phone in the kitchen.","zh":"睡前狂刷負面新聞一小時後，我感到焦慮又睡不著，所以我現在都把手機放在廚房。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A91","t":"狂刷負面新聞"},{"w":"screen time","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the time you spend looking at a screen","cn":"螢幕使用時間","s":"My parents limit my ______ ______ to two hours a day, so I have more time for sport and reading.","zh":"我爸媽把我的螢幕使用時間限制在一天兩小時，所以我有更多時間運動和閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"Social Media & the Internet 社群媒體與網路","lab":"A92","t":"螢幕使用時間"},{"w":"disinformation","pos":"n.","def":"false information spread on purpose to trick people","cn":"蓄意造假的訊息；假訊息","s":"The ________ campaign used fake accounts to spread lies about the vaccine, so many parents became afraid to protect their children.","zh":"那場假訊息攻勢利用假帳號散播關於疫苗的謊言，所以許多家長變得不敢讓孩子接種。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A93","t":"假訊息"},{"w":"fake news","pos":"n.phr.","def":"false stories that look like real news","cn":"假新聞","s":"My uncle shared a story about free money from the government, but it was ______ ______, so I showed him the official website.","zh":"我叔叔分享了一則政府發放免費現金的消息，但那是假新聞，所以我給他看了官方網站。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A94","t":"假新聞"},{"w":"hoax","pos":"n.","def":"a trick that makes people believe something false","cn":"騙局；惡作劇","s":"The photo of a shark swimming on the highway was a ________, but thousands of people believed it during the flood.","zh":"那張鯊魚在高速公路上游泳的照片是個惡作劇，但淹水期間成千上萬的人都信以為真。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A95","t":"惡作劇"},{"w":"rumour","pos":"n.","def":"a story passed between people that may not be true","cn":"謠言；傳聞","s":"A ________ spread that the school would close for a week, but the principal soon announced that it was not true.","zh":"有謠言說學校會停課一週，但校長很快就宣布那不是真的。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A96","t":"謠言"},{"w":"gossip","pos":"n.","def":"talk about other people's private lives","cn":"八卦；閒話","s":"The office ________ about the manager turned out to be false, but it had already damaged her reputation.","zh":"辦公室裡關於經理的八卦結果是假的，但它已經損害了她的名聲。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A97","t":"八卦"},{"w":"propaganda","pos":"n.","def":"information used by a government or group to control opinions","cn":"政治宣傳","s":"During the war, both sides used ________ posters to make their own soldiers look like heroes and the enemy look evil.","zh":"戰爭期間雙方都用宣傳海報把自己的士兵塑造成英雄，把敵人塑造成邪惡的。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A98","t":"宣傳"},{"w":"conspiracy theory","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a belief that a secret group caused an event","cn":"陰謀論","s":"He believes a ______ ______ that the moon landing was filmed in a studio, although scientists have shown clear evidence against it.","zh":"他相信登月是在攝影棚拍攝的陰謀論，儘管科學家已提出明確的反駁證據。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A99","t":"陰謀論"},{"w":"clickbait","pos":"n.","def":"online content with a misleading title to get clicks","cn":"釣魚標題；點擊誘餌","s":"The title promised a shocking secret about celebrities, but it was just ________, and the article said nothing new.","zh":"那個標題承諾要揭露名人驚人的秘密，但它只是釣魚標題，文章沒有任何新內容。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A100","t":"釣魚標題"},{"w":"falsehood","pos":"n.","def":"a statement that is not true","cn":"謊言；不實之詞","s":"The politician repeated the same ________ in every speech, so many voters began to believe it was true.","zh":"那位政治人物在每場演講中重複同一個不實說法，所以許多選民開始相信那是真的。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A101","t":"不實說法"},{"w":"half-truth","pos":"n.","def":"a statement that is partly true but hides important facts","cn":"半真半假的話","s":"The advert said the drink had \"no added sugar\", which was a ________, because the juice itself was full of natural sugar.","zh":"那則廣告說這飲料「無添加糖」，這是半真半假的說法，因為果汁本身就充滿天然糖分。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A102","t":"半真半假的說法"},{"w":"misquote","pos":"v.","def":"to repeat someone's words wrongly","cn":"錯誤引用（某人的話）","s":"The singer said the newspaper had ________ her, because she never said that she hated her fans.","zh":"那位歌手說報紙錯誤引用了她的話，因為她從未說過她討厭她的粉絲。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A103","t":"錯誤引用"},{"w":"doctored","pos":"adj.","def":"changed in a dishonest way","cn":"竄改過的；動過手腳的","s":"The ________ photo made the crowd look much bigger, but experts noticed that some faces appeared twice.","zh":"那張動過手腳的照片讓人群看起來大很多，但專家注意到有些臉出現了兩次。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A104","t":"動過手腳的"},{"w":"smear campaign","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an organised effort to damage someone's reputation with lies","cn":"抹黑行動","s":"The candidate said she was the victim of a ______ ______, because fake stories about her family appeared just before the election.","zh":"那位候選人說她是抹黑行動的受害者，因為選舉前夕突然出現許多關於她家人的假消息。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A105","t":"抹黑行動"},{"w":"defamation","pos":"n.","def":"harming someone's reputation by saying false things","cn":"誹謗","s":"The restaurant owner sued the blogger for ________, because the review falsely claimed that customers had become ill.","zh":"餐廳老闆控告那位部落客誹謗，因為那篇評論不實地聲稱顧客吃了生病。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A106","t":"誹謗"},{"w":"libel","pos":"n.","def":"false written statements that damage someone's reputation","cn":"（書面）誹謗","s":"The magazine had to pay a large fine for ________, because it published false claims about a businessman.","zh":"那本雜誌因書面誹謗必須支付一大筆罰款，因為它刊登了關於一位商人的不實指控。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A107","t":"書面誹謗"},{"w":"slander","pos":"n.","def":"false spoken statements that damage someone's reputation","cn":"（口頭）誹謗；中傷","s":"What he said about his neighbour on the radio was ________, so the neighbour asked a lawyer for help.","zh":"他在廣播上說他鄰居的那些話是中傷，所以那位鄰居請律師幫忙。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A108","t":"中傷"},{"w":"spin","pos":"n.","def":"presenting information in a way that makes you look good","cn":"（對消息的）粉飾；操弄說法","s":"The company called the job cuts \"a new start\", but everyone knew it was just ________, and the workers were still angry.","zh":"公司把裁員稱為「新的開始」，但大家都知道那只是粉飾說法，員工們仍然很憤怒。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A109","t":"粉飾說法"},{"w":"spin doctor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person paid to make news look good for a politician","cn":"公關操盤手；政治化妝師","s":"The minister's ______ ______ quickly changed the story, so the scandal disappeared from the news within two days.","zh":"部長的公關操盤手很快就轉移了焦點，所以那件醜聞兩天內就從新聞中消失了。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A110","t":"公關操盤手"},{"w":"bot","pos":"n.","def":"a computer program that acts like a real user online","cn":"機器人帳號；網軍程式","s":"Many of the accounts praising the product were ________, because they all posted the same message at the same time.","zh":"許多稱讚那項產品的帳號都是機器人帳號，因為它們都在同一時間發布同樣的訊息。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A111","t":"機器人帳號"},{"w":"troll farm","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group paid to post false or angry comments online","cn":"網軍工廠","s":"Investigators found that a ______ ______ had created thousands of fake profiles, and they were all spreading the same rumours.","zh":"調查人員發現一個網軍工廠創造了數千個假帳號，而它們都在散播同樣的謠言。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A112","t":"網軍工廠"},{"w":"fearmongering","pos":"n.","def":"spreading fear to make people believe or do something","cn":"散播恐懼；危言聳聽","s":"Some news channels were accused of ________ during the outbreak, because they showed panic but gave little useful advice.","zh":"疫情期間有些新聞台被指控散播恐慌，因為它們只呈現恐慌卻很少提供有用的建議。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A113","t":"散播恐慌"},{"w":"hearsay","pos":"n.","def":"information you heard from others but cannot prove","cn":"傳聞；道聽塗說","s":"The report was based on ________ rather than real evidence, so the editor refused to publish it.","zh":"那篇報導是根據道聽塗說而不是真正的證據，所以編輯拒絕刊登它。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A114","t":"道聽塗說"},{"w":"unverified","pos":"adj.","def":"not yet checked or proved to be true","cn":"未經證實的","s":"The TV channel showed ________ videos from the scene, but later some of them turned out to be from a different country.","zh":"那家電視台播出了現場未經證實的影片，但後來其中一些被證實來自別的國家。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A115","t":"未經證實的"},{"w":"gullible","pos":"adj.","def":"too easily tricked into believing things","cn":"容易受騙的","s":"My little brother is so ________ that he believed a website saying cats can speak French, and he tried to teach ours.","zh":"我弟弟非常容易受騙，他相信了一個說貓會講法語的網站，還試著教我們家的貓。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A116","t":"容易受騙"},{"w":"impostor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who pretends to be someone else","cn":"冒牌貨；冒名者","s":"An ________ created an account with the actor's photos, so fans sent money to someone who was not really him.","zh":"一個冒名者用那位演員的照片開了帳號，所以粉絲把錢匯給了一個根本不是他的人。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A117","t":"冒名者"},{"w":"satire","pos":"n.","def":"humour that makes fun of people or ideas to criticise them","cn":"諷刺作品","s":"The article was ________ from a comedy website, but some readers did not understand the joke and believed it was real news.","zh":"那篇文章是喜劇網站的諷刺作品，但有些讀者不懂那是玩笑，以為是真的新聞。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A118","t":"諷刺作品"},{"w":"parody","pos":"n.","def":"a funny copy of something that exaggerates it","cn":"模仿惡搞作品","s":"The students made a ________ of the school's promotional video, and even the teachers laughed when they watched it.","zh":"學生們拍了一部學校宣傳影片的惡搞版，連老師們看了都笑了。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A119","t":"惡搞版"},{"w":"cherry-pick","pos":"v.","def":"to choose only facts that support your view","cn":"挑選對自己有利的（事實）","s":"The report ________ the best results from the study, so it ignored the data showing that the drug did not work for most people.","zh":"那份報告只挑選研究中最好的結果，所以它忽略了顯示這藥物對多數人無效的數據。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A120","t":"只挑選"},{"w":"partisan","pos":"adj.","def":"strongly supporting one political party","cn":"偏袒某一黨派的","s":"The TV station is very ________, so it rarely reports any good news about the opposition party.","zh":"那家電視台非常偏袒特定政黨，所以它很少報導任何關於反對黨的好消息。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A121","t":"偏袒特定政黨"},{"w":"infodemic","pos":"n.","def":"too much information, including false information, during a crisis","cn":"資訊疫情；訊息氾濫","s":"During the pandemic there was an ________ of advice online, and it was hard to know which tips were safe.","zh":"疫情期間網路上出現了建議的資訊疫情，很難知道哪些建議是安全的。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A122","t":"資訊疫情"},{"w":"outrage","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling of anger and shock","cn":"憤慨；義憤","s":"The video caused ________ online, but later people discovered that it had been edited to look much worse.","zh":"那段影片在網路上引起公憤，但後來人們發現它被剪輯得看起來更嚴重。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A123","t":"公憤"},{"w":"inflammatory","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to make people angry or violent","cn":"煽動性的；激起憤怒的","s":"The post used ________ language about immigrants, so the platform removed it and suspended the account.","zh":"那則貼文使用了關於移民的煽動性語言，所以平台刪除了它並停用該帳號。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A124","t":"煽動性"},{"w":"sensationalism","pos":"n.","def":"presenting news in a shocking way to attract attention","cn":"譁眾取寵的報導手法；煽情主義","s":"________ helps sell newspapers, but it often makes small risks seem much bigger than they really are.","zh":"煽情主義有助於賣報紙，但它常把小風險渲染得比實際嚴重得多。","part":"A","sec":"Misinformation & Fake News 假訊息與假新聞","lab":"A125","t":"煽情主義"},{"w":"fact-check","pos":"v.","def":"to make sure that information is correct","cn":"查核事實","s":"Before you share a shocking story, you should ________ it on a reliable website, because many viral posts are false.","zh":"在分享一則驚人的消息之前，你應該到可靠的網站查核事實，因為許多爆紅的貼文是假的。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A126","t":"查核事實"},{"w":"fact-checker","pos":"n.","def":"a person or group that checks if claims are true","cn":"事實查核員；查核機構","s":"A ________ found that the quote was invented, so the newspaper removed the article and apologised.","zh":"一位事實查核員發現那句引言是捏造的，所以報社撤下文章並道歉。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A127","t":"事實查核員"},{"w":"media literacy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ability to judge and understand news and media","cn":"媒體素養","s":"Our school teaches ______ ______ in Year 10, so students learn how to recognise fake photos and misleading headlines.","zh":"我們學校在十年級教媒體素養，所以學生學習如何辨認假照片和誤導性標題。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A128","t":"媒體素養"},{"w":"reverse image search","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a search that finds where a picture first appeared","cn":"以圖搜圖；反向圖片搜尋","s":"I did a ______ ______ ______ on the photo, and I found that it was taken five years earlier in another country.","zh":"我對那張照片做了以圖搜圖，發現它是五年前在另一個國家拍的。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A129","t":"以圖搜圖"},{"w":"citation","pos":"n.","def":"a note showing where information came from","cn":"引用；出處","s":"Wikipedia asks writers to add a ________ for every fact, so readers can check the original source themselves.","zh":"維基百科要求作者為每個事實加上出處，讓讀者可以自己查證原始來源。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A130","t":"出處"},{"w":"cross-check","pos":"v.","def":"to check information using a different source","cn":"交叉比對；交叉核對","s":"Good reporters ________ every claim with at least two sources, because one person might be mistaken or lying.","zh":"優秀的記者會用至少兩個來源交叉核對每一項說法，因為一個人可能弄錯或說謊。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A131","t":"交叉核對"},{"w":"retraction","pos":"n.","def":"a statement saying something published earlier was wrong","cn":"撤回聲明；撤稿","s":"The magazine printed a ________ the following week, but far fewer people saw it than the original false story.","zh":"那本雜誌隔週刊登了撤回聲明，但看到的人比原本那則假報導少得多。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A132","t":"撤回聲明"},{"w":"correction","pos":"n.","def":"a notice that fixes a mistake in a report","cn":"更正啟事；更正","s":"The website added a ________ at the bottom of the article, because the date of the event had been wrong.","zh":"那個網站在文章底部加上了更正啟事，因為活動日期寫錯了。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A133","t":"更正啟事"},{"w":"disclaimer","pos":"n.","def":"a statement saying you are not responsible for something","cn":"免責聲明","s":"The video had a ________ saying it was for entertainment only, but many viewers still treated it as medical advice.","zh":"那部影片有一則免責聲明說它僅供娛樂，但許多觀眾仍然把它當作醫療建議。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A134","t":"免責聲明"},{"w":"reputable","pos":"adj.","def":"known to be honest and reliable","cn":"聲譽良好的；可信賴的","s":"For your project, please use ________ sources such as university websites, because blogs may contain personal opinions.","zh":"做專題時請使用信譽良好的資料來源，例如大學網站，因為部落格可能包含個人意見。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A135","t":"信譽良好的"},{"w":"authoritative","pos":"adj.","def":"trusted because it comes from an expert","cn":"權威的；可信的","s":"The health ministry's website is the most ________ source of vaccine information, so I always check it first.","zh":"衛福部的網站是疫苗資訊最權威的來源，所以我總是先查看它。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A136","t":"權威的"},{"w":"lateral reading","pos":"n.phr.","def":"checking a site by reading what other sites say about it","cn":"橫向閱讀","s":"Instead of staying on one website, try ______ ______, because other sources can tell you whether that site is trustworthy.","zh":"不要只停留在一個網站上，試試橫向閱讀，因為其他來源可以告訴你那個網站是否可信。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A137","t":"橫向閱讀"},{"w":"timestamp","pos":"n.","def":"the date and time when something was posted or recorded","cn":"時間戳記","s":"The ________ on the video showed it was filmed in 2019, so it could not be from yesterday's storm.","zh":"影片上的時間戳記顯示它是在 2019 年拍的，所以它不可能是昨天暴風雨的畫面。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A138","t":"時間戳記"},{"w":"metadata","pos":"n.","def":"hidden information about a digital file","cn":"詮釋資料；後設資料","s":"Experts studied the photo's ________, and they discovered the exact phone and date used to take it.","zh":"專家研究了照片的詮釋資料，發現了拍攝時所用的手機型號與確切日期。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A139","t":"詮釋資料"},{"w":"watermark","pos":"n.","def":"a faint logo on an image to show who owns it","cn":"浮水印","s":"The photographer adds a ________ to every picture, so other websites cannot use her work without permission.","zh":"那位攝影師在每張照片上都加浮水印，所以其他網站無法未經許可使用她的作品。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A140","t":"浮水印"},{"w":"evidence-based","pos":"adj.","def":"based on facts from research","cn":"以證據為基礎的；實證的","s":"The doctor only gives ________ advice, so she told us not to trust diet tips from random videos.","zh":"那位醫生只給有實證根據的建議，所以她告訴我們不要相信隨便哪部影片裡的減肥秘訣。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A141","t":"有實證根據的"},{"w":"moderator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who checks and controls posts in an online group","cn":"版主；內容審核員","s":"The forum ________ deletes rude comments quickly, so the discussion usually stays friendly and helpful.","zh":"那個論壇的版主很快就會刪除無禮的留言，所以討論通常保持友善且有幫助。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A142","t":"版主"},{"w":"flag","pos":"v.","def":"to mark something as possibly wrong or harmful","cn":"標記；檢舉","s":"Users can ________ posts that look false, and then the platform sends them to fact-checkers for review.","zh":"使用者可以標記看起來不實的貼文，然後平台會把它們送交事實查核員審查。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A143","t":"標記"},{"w":"takedown","pos":"n.","def":"the removal of content from a website","cn":"下架；移除","s":"After the singer complained, the website received a ________ notice, so the stolen song was removed within hours.","zh":"那位歌手投訴後，網站收到了下架通知，所以被盜用的歌曲在幾小時內就被移除了。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A144","t":"下架"},{"w":"mistrust","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that you cannot believe someone","cn":"不信任；猜疑","s":"Years of false promises have created deep ________ of politicians, so many young people no longer bother to vote.","zh":"多年來的虛假承諾造成了對政治人物深深的不信任，所以許多年輕人不再費心去投票。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A145","t":"不信任"},{"w":"trust","pos":"n.","def":"the belief that someone is honest and reliable","cn":"信任","s":"Once a news channel loses viewers' ________, it is very difficult to win back, even if it apologises.","zh":"一家新聞台一旦失去觀眾的信任，即使道歉也很難再贏回來。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A146","t":"信任"},{"w":"slant","pos":"n.","def":"a way of presenting news that favours one side","cn":"偏頗角度；傾向","s":"The article had a clear political ________, because it quoted only people who supported the new law.","zh":"那篇文章有明顯的政治傾向，因為它只引用了支持新法的人的話。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A147","t":"傾向"},{"w":"loaded language","pos":"n.phr.","def":"words chosen to create strong emotions","cn":"情緒性字眼；煽情用語","s":"The report used ______ ______ like \"invasion\" and \"disaster\", so readers felt scared before they knew the facts.","zh":"那篇報導使用了「入侵」和「災難」等情緒性字眼，所以讀者在了解事實之前就感到害怕。","part":"A","sec":"Fact-Checking & Media Literacy 事實查核與媒體素養","lab":"A148","t":"情緒性字眼"},{"w":"advertising","pos":"n.","def":"the business of telling people about products to sell them","cn":"廣告業；廣告宣傳","s":"The company spends more money on ________ than on research, so its products are famous but not very good.","zh":"那家公司花在廣告上的錢比研究還多，所以它的產品很有名但不太好。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A149","t":"廣告"},{"w":"advertisement","pos":"n.","def":"a notice or video that tries to sell something","cn":"廣告","s":"I saw an ________ for a cheap phone online, but the price was much higher when I got to the shop.","zh":"我在網路上看到一則便宜手機的廣告，但我到店裡時價格高得多。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A150","t":"廣告"},{"w":"advertiser","pos":"n.","def":"a company that pays for adverts","cn":"廣告主；廣告商","s":"Many ________ left the platform after hateful posts appeared next to their adverts, so the company lost millions.","zh":"仇恨貼文出現在廣告旁邊後，許多廣告主離開了那個平台，所以那家公司損失了數百萬。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A151","t":"廣告主"},{"w":"slogan","pos":"n.","def":"a short, catchy phrase used in advertising","cn":"標語；口號","s":"The shop's ________ is \"Fresh every morning\", and customers remember it because it is short and easy to say.","zh":"那家店的標語是「每天早上都新鮮」，顧客記得它，因為它又短又好念。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A152","t":"標語"},{"w":"billboard","pos":"n.","def":"a very large outdoor sign for adverts","cn":"廣告看板","s":"A huge ________ beside the highway shows a new car, so thousands of drivers see it every day on their way to work.","zh":"高速公路旁一面巨大的廣告看板展示一款新車，所以每天有數千名駕駛在上班途中看到它。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A153","t":"廣告看板"},{"w":"brochure","pos":"n.","def":"a small magazine with pictures and information about a product or place","cn":"小冊子；宣傳手冊","s":"The hotel ________ showed a quiet beach, but when we arrived the beach was crowded and full of rubbish.","zh":"飯店的宣傳手冊展示了一片寧靜的海灘，但我們抵達時海灘擁擠又滿是垃圾。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A154","t":"宣傳手冊"},{"w":"flyer","pos":"n.","def":"a printed paper giving information about an event or offer","cn":"傳單","s":"A student handed me a ________ about the charity concert, and I decided to go because the tickets were cheap.","zh":"一位學生遞給我一張慈善音樂會的傳單，我決定去，因為門票很便宜。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A155","t":"傳單"},{"w":"poster","pos":"n.","def":"a large printed picture or notice on a wall","cn":"海報","s":"We put up a ________ about the beach clean-up in the school hall, and more than fifty students signed up.","zh":"我們在學校大廳貼了一張淨灘活動的海報，有五十多位學生報名。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A156","t":"海報"},{"w":"jingle","pos":"n.","def":"a short, catchy song used in an advert","cn":"廣告歌","s":"The ________ for the noodle advert was so catchy that my little sister sang it all day long.","zh":"那則泡麵廣告的廣告歌太洗腦了，我妹妹一整天都在唱。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A157","t":"廣告歌"},{"w":"logo","pos":"n.","def":"a symbol that represents a company","cn":"商標；標誌","s":"The company changed its ________ to a simpler design, but many customers preferred the old one and complained online.","zh":"那家公司把標誌換成更簡單的設計，但許多顧客比較喜歡舊的，還在網路上抱怨。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A158","t":"標誌"},{"w":"brand","pos":"n.","def":"a product name made by a particular company","cn":"品牌","s":"My mother always buys the same ________ of soap, because she trusts it and does not want to try new ones.","zh":"我媽媽總是買同一個品牌的肥皂，因為她信任它，不想嘗試新的。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A159","t":"品牌"},{"w":"publicity","pos":"n.","def":"attention given to someone or something by the media","cn":"宣傳；曝光度","s":"The film got a lot of free ________ when its star was seen at the festival, so ticket sales rose quickly.","zh":"那部電影的主角在影展亮相後，它獲得了大量免費曝光，所以票房迅速上升。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A160","t":"曝光"},{"w":"public relations","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the work of creating a good image for an organisation","cn":"公共關係；公關","s":"After the food poisoning case, the restaurant hired a ______ ______ firm, because it needed to win back customers' trust.","zh":"發生食物中毒事件後，那家餐廳聘請了一家公關公司，因為它需要贏回顧客的信任。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A161","t":"公關"},{"w":"spokesperson","pos":"n.","def":"a person who speaks officially for a group","cn":"發言人","s":"A ________ for the airline apologised for the delays, but she did not explain why so many flights were cancelled.","zh":"航空公司的發言人為延誤道歉，但她沒有解釋為什麼取消了那麼多班機。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A162","t":"發言人"},{"w":"marketing","pos":"n.","def":"the work of promoting and selling products","cn":"行銷","s":"The new drink was not very tasty, but clever ________ on social media made it popular with teenagers.","zh":"那款新飲料不太好喝，但社群媒體上聰明的行銷讓它在青少年之間很受歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A163","t":"行銷"},{"w":"product placement","pos":"n.phr.","def":"showing a brand inside a film or show to advertise it","cn":"置入性行銷","s":"The hero drinks the same brand of coffee in every scene, so it is obvious that this is ______ ______.","zh":"主角在每一幕都喝同一個牌子的咖啡，所以很明顯這是置入性行銷。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A164","t":"置入性行銷"},{"w":"pop-up ad","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an advert that suddenly appears in a new window online","cn":"彈出式廣告","s":"A ______ ______ appeared while I was reading the news, and it was so hard to close that I left the website.","zh":"我在看新聞時跳出一則彈出式廣告，它難關到我乾脆離開了那個網站。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A165","t":"彈出式廣告"},{"w":"sponsored content","pos":"n.phr.","def":"material paid for by a company but made to look like normal posts","cn":"業配內容；贊助內容","s":"Many travel videos are actually ______ ______, so the hotels in them may have paid for the good reviews.","zh":"許多旅遊影片其實是業配內容，所以影片中的飯店可能付了錢換取好評。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A166","t":"業配內容"},{"w":"catchphrase","pos":"n.","def":"a short phrase that a famous person often says","cn":"口頭禪；流行語","s":"The comedian's ________ became so popular that students repeated it in class, and some teachers found it annoying.","zh":"那位喜劇演員的口頭禪變得非常流行，學生們在課堂上一直重複，有些老師覺得很煩。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A167","t":"口頭禪"},{"w":"testimonial","pos":"n.","def":"a statement from a customer praising a product","cn":"使用者推薦；見證","s":"The website was full of glowing ________, but I later learned that some of them were written by the company's staff.","zh":"那個網站滿是讚不絕口的顧客推薦，但我後來得知其中一些是公司員工寫的。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A168","t":"顧客推薦"},{"w":"mascot","pos":"n.","def":"a character or animal that represents a team or company","cn":"吉祥物","s":"The city's bear ________ appears at every festival, and children love taking pictures with it.","zh":"這座城市的熊吉祥物出現在每個節慶活動上，孩子們很喜歡和它拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A169","t":"吉祥物"},{"w":"rebrand","pos":"v.","def":"to change the name or image of a company or product","cn":"品牌重塑；改頭換面","s":"The airline ________ itself after a terrible accident, because many passengers connected the old name with danger.","zh":"那家航空公司在一場嚴重事故後進行了品牌重塑，因為許多乘客把舊名稱和危險聯想在一起。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A170","t":"品牌重塑"},{"w":"consumer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who buys goods or services","cn":"消費者","s":"Every ________ has the right to know what is in their food, so the law requires clear labels on packaging.","zh":"每位消費者都有權知道食物裡有什麼，所以法律要求包裝上有清楚的標示。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A171","t":"消費者"},{"w":"hype","pos":"n.","def":"exaggerated excitement and advertising about something","cn":"炒作；大肆宣傳","s":"There was so much ________ about the new game, but when it was released it was full of bugs and many players were disappointed.","zh":"那款新遊戲被大肆炒作，但發售時卻充滿錯誤，許多玩家都很失望。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A172","t":"炒作"},{"w":"buzz","pos":"n.","def":"excited talk about something new","cn":"話題；熱烈討論","s":"The trailer created a lot of ________ online, so the cinema added extra showings on the first weekend.","zh":"那支預告片在網路上引起大量話題，所以電影院在首映週末加開了場次。","part":"A","sec":"Advertising, PR & Persuasion 廣告、公關與說服","lab":"A173","t":"話題"},{"w":"interpersonal","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to relationships between people","cn":"人際的","s":"Good ________ skills are important for nurses, because they need to comfort worried patients and work closely with doctors.","zh":"良好的人際技巧對護理師很重要，因為他們需要安撫擔心的病人並與醫生密切合作。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A174","t":"人際"},{"w":"verbal","pos":"adj.","def":"using spoken words","cn":"口頭的；言語的","s":"The coach gave us ________ instructions during the game, but the crowd was so loud that we could hardly hear him.","zh":"教練在比賽中給了我們口頭指示，但觀眾太吵了，我們幾乎聽不到他說話。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A175","t":"口頭"},{"w":"non-verbal","pos":"adj.","def":"without words, such as through body movements","cn":"非語言的","s":"Smiling and nodding are ________ signals, and they show the speaker that you are listening carefully.","zh":"微笑和點頭是非語言訊號，它們向說話者表示你正在仔細聆聽。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A176","t":"非語言"},{"w":"gesture","pos":"n.","def":"a movement of the hand or head to show meaning","cn":"手勢；姿態","s":"A thumbs-up is a friendly ________ in Taiwan, but in some countries it can be rude, so travellers should be careful.","zh":"豎起大拇指在台灣是友善的手勢，但在某些國家可能是無禮的，所以旅客應該小心。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A177","t":"手勢"},{"w":"eye contact","pos":"n.phr.","def":"looking directly into someone's eyes","cn":"眼神接觸","s":"Try to make ______ ______ with the interviewer, because looking at the floor may make you seem nervous or dishonest.","zh":"試著和面試官保持眼神接觸，因為看著地板可能會讓你顯得緊張或不誠實。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A178","t":"眼神接觸"},{"w":"tone of voice","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way your voice sounds, showing your feelings","cn":"語氣；說話的口氣","s":"She said \"fine\", but her ______ ______ ______ was cold, so I knew she was still angry with me.","zh":"她說「好啊」，但她的語氣很冷淡，所以我知道她還在生我的氣。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A179","t":"語氣"},{"w":"active listening","pos":"n.phr.","def":"listening carefully and showing that you understand","cn":"主動聆聽；積極傾聽","s":"______ ______ means asking questions and repeating key points, so the other person feels that you really care.","zh":"主動聆聽的意思是提出問題並複述重點，讓對方覺得你真的在乎。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A180","t":"主動聆聽"},{"w":"small talk","pos":"n.phr.","def":"polite conversation about unimportant things","cn":"閒聊；寒暄","s":"At the party I made ______ ______ about the weather, because I did not know anyone and felt a little shy.","zh":"在派對上我聊了些天氣之類的閒聊，因為我誰都不認識，覺得有點害羞。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A181","t":"閒聊"},{"w":"conversation","pos":"n.","def":"a talk between two or more people","cn":"對話；談話","s":"We had a long ________ about our future plans, and I realised that my best friend wants to study abroad.","zh":"我們針對未來計畫進行了一段很長的談話，我才發現我最好的朋友想出國留學。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A182","t":"談話"},{"w":"dialogue","pos":"n.","def":"a discussion between groups to solve a problem","cn":"對話；交流","s":"The two countries began a ________ about the fishing dispute, so many people hoped the conflict would end peacefully.","zh":"兩國就漁業爭端展開對話，所以許多人希望衝突能和平結束。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A183","t":"對話"},{"w":"miscommunication","pos":"n.","def":"a failure to share information clearly","cn":"溝通不良；誤傳","s":"Because of a ________ between the teachers, two classes arrived at the gym at the same time, and nobody knew which one should leave.","zh":"由於老師之間的溝通不良，兩個班同時到了體育館，沒有人知道哪一班該離開。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A184","t":"溝通不良"},{"w":"text message","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a short written message sent by phone","cn":"簡訊；手機訊息","s":"I sent my mother a ______ ______ to say the bus was late, so she would not worry when I got home after dark.","zh":"我傳了一則簡訊給媽媽說公車誤點，這樣我天黑才到家時她就不會擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A185","t":"簡訊"},{"w":"voicemail","pos":"n.","def":"a spoken message left on a phone","cn":"語音留言","s":"The doctor did not answer, so I left a ________ asking her to call me back when she was free.","zh":"醫生沒有接電話，所以我留了一則語音留言，請她有空時回電給我。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A186","t":"語音留言"},{"w":"email","pos":"n.","def":"a message sent over the internet","cn":"電子郵件","s":"I wrote a polite ________ to my teacher to ask for more time, and she kindly agreed to give me two extra days.","zh":"我寫了一封有禮貌的電子郵件給老師要求延期，她很親切地同意多給我兩天。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A187","t":"電子郵件"},{"w":"pen pal","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a friend in another place you write letters to","cn":"筆友","s":"I have a ______ ______ in Canada, and we have been writing to each other for three years, so my English has improved a lot.","zh":"我在加拿大有一位筆友，我們已經互相寫信三年了，所以我的英文進步很多。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A188","t":"筆友"},{"w":"video call","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a call where people can see each other on screen","cn":"視訊通話","s":"My grandparents live in the countryside, but we make a ______ ______ every Sunday, so they can see how the children are growing.","zh":"我的祖父母住在鄉下，但我們每個星期天都會視訊通話，讓他們看看孩子們長大了多少。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A189","t":"視訊通話"},{"w":"public speaking","pos":"n.phr.","def":"speaking in front of a large group of people","cn":"公開演說","s":"Many students are afraid of ______ ______, but practising in front of a mirror can help them feel more confident.","zh":"許多學生害怕公開演說，但在鏡子前練習能幫助他們更有自信。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A190","t":"公開演說"},{"w":"speech","pos":"n.","def":"a formal talk given to an audience","cn":"演講；致詞","s":"The principal gave a short ________ at graduation, and several parents cried when she thanked the students' families.","zh":"校長在畢業典禮上發表了簡短的致詞，她感謝學生家庭時，好幾位家長都哭了。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A191","t":"致詞"},{"w":"stage fright","pos":"n.phr.","def":"nervousness before performing or speaking in public","cn":"怯場","s":"He had terrible ______ ______ before the debate, but after the first minute he relaxed and spoke clearly.","zh":"辯論前他嚴重怯場，但第一分鐘過後他就放鬆下來，說得很清楚。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A192","t":"怯場"},{"w":"etiquette","pos":"n.","def":"the rules of polite behaviour","cn":"禮節；禮儀","s":"Business ________ is different in every country, so it is a good idea to learn the basics before you travel for work.","zh":"商務禮儀在每個國家都不同，所以出差前先學一些基本知識是個好主意。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A193","t":"禮儀"},{"w":"netiquette","pos":"n.","def":"rules for polite behaviour on the internet","cn":"網路禮儀","s":"Typing in capital letters is bad ________, because readers feel as if you are shouting at them.","zh":"全用大寫字母打字是不好的網路禮儀，因為讀者會覺得你好像在對他們大吼。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A194","t":"網路禮儀"},{"w":"courteous","pos":"adj.","def":"polite and respectful","cn":"有禮貌的；謙恭的","s":"The hotel staff were very ________, so we felt welcome even though our room was not ready yet.","zh":"飯店員工非常有禮貌，所以即使我們的房間還沒準備好，我們仍覺得受到歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A195","t":"有禮貌"},{"w":"tactful","pos":"adj.","def":"careful not to upset people when saying difficult things","cn":"圓融的；得體的","s":"She was ________ when she told me my essay needed work, so I did not feel hurt and was happy to improve it.","zh":"她告訴我作文需要修改時說得很委婉得體，所以我沒有受傷，也很樂意改進。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A196","t":"委婉得體"},{"w":"blunt","pos":"adj.","def":"saying exactly what you think, even if it is rude","cn":"直率的；說話不客氣的","s":"My uncle is very ________ and says whatever he thinks, so he sometimes upsets people without meaning to.","zh":"我叔叔說話非常直白，想到什麼就說什麼，所以他有時候會無意間讓人不高興。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A197","t":"直白"},{"w":"talkative","pos":"adj.","def":"liking to talk a lot","cn":"健談的；愛說話的","s":"My little sister is very ________ at home, but she becomes quiet and shy when she meets new people.","zh":"我妹妹在家裡很愛說話，但遇到陌生人時就變得安靜又害羞。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A198","t":"愛說話"},{"w":"slang","pos":"n.","def":"very informal words used by a particular group","cn":"俚語","s":"Teenagers often use ________ that their parents do not understand, so family conversations can be confusing.","zh":"青少年常用父母聽不懂的俚語，所以家庭對話可能會讓人摸不著頭緒。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A199","t":"俚語"},{"w":"acronym","pos":"n.","def":"a word made from the first letters of other words","cn":"首字母縮略字","s":"\"NASA\" is an ________ that people say as one word, and many students do not know what the letters stand for.","zh":"「NASA」是一個人們當作一個字來唸的首字母縮略字，許多學生不知道那些字母代表什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Interpersonal Skills 溝通與人際技巧","lab":"A200","t":"首字母縮略字"},{"w":"conjure","pos":"v.","def":"to make a picture or idea appear in someone's mind","cn":"使浮現；變出","s":"The word \"headline\" ________ images of big black letters, but today most headlines appear on small phone screens.","zh":"「頭條」這個字會讓人聯想到大大的黑色字體，但如今大多數標題都出現在小小的手機螢幕上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"讓人聯想到"},{"w":"decry","pos":"v.","def":"to say publicly that something is bad","cn":"公開譴責；抨擊","s":"Many teachers ________ the use of phones in class, but some argue that phones can be useful learning tools.","zh":"許多老師抨擊在課堂上使用手機，但也有人認為手機可以是有用的學習工具。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"抨擊"},{"w":"denigrate","pos":"v.","def":"to say that someone or something is not good or important","cn":"詆毀；貶低","s":"The new advert openly ________ rival brands, so many viewers complained that it was unfair and unkind.","zh":"那則新廣告公然貶低競爭品牌，所以許多觀眾抱怨它不公平又不厚道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"貶低"},{"w":"disavow","pos":"v.","def":"to say you are not connected with something","cn":"否認（與…有關）；撇清","s":"The party quickly ________ the fake website, because it was spreading lies in the party's name.","zh":"該黨很快就撇清與那個假網站的關係，因為它以該黨的名義散播謊言。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"撇清"},{"w":"discount","pos":"v.","def":"to decide that something is not important or true","cn":"不理會；不全信","s":"You should not ________ a story just because you dislike the newspaper, so always look at the evidence first.","zh":"你不應該只因為不喜歡那家報紙就不採信一則報導，所以一定要先看證據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"不採信"},{"w":"disparage","pos":"v.","def":"to speak about someone in a way that shows no respect","cn":"貶損；輕視","s":"The host often ________ his guests to get laughs, but many viewers found his jokes cruel rather than funny.","zh":"那位主持人常常貶損來賓來博取笑聲，但許多觀眾覺得他的笑話殘忍而不好笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"貶損"},{"w":"divulge","pos":"v.","def":"to tell secret information","cn":"洩漏；透露","s":"The reporter refused to ________ her source, even though the court threatened to fine her.","zh":"那位記者拒絕透露她的消息來源，即使法院威脅要對她罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"透露"},{"w":"downplay","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem less important than it is","cn":"淡化；輕描淡寫","s":"The company tried to ________ the data leak, but customers were angry when they learned how many accounts were affected.","zh":"那家公司試圖淡化資料外洩事件，但顧客得知有多少帳號受影響時非常憤怒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"淡化"},{"w":"dramatise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem more exciting or serious than it is","cn":"誇大；戲劇化","s":"The video ________ a small argument between neighbours, so it looked like a violent fight.","zh":"那段影片把鄰居間的小爭執戲劇化了，所以看起來像一場暴力衝突。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"戲劇化"},{"w":"embroil","pos":"v.","def":"to involve someone in a difficult situation","cn":"使捲入（糾紛）","s":"The singer became ________ in a copyright battle, and her new album was delayed for over a year.","zh":"那位歌手捲入了一場版權糾紛，她的新專輯延遲了一年多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"捲入"},{"w":"equivocate","pos":"v.","def":"to avoid giving a clear answer","cn":"含糊其辭；支吾搪塞","s":"The minister ________ when reporters asked about the budget, so nobody knew whether the new hospital would be built.","zh":"記者詢問預算時部長含糊其辭，所以沒有人知道新醫院會不會蓋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"含糊其辭"},{"w":"garble","pos":"v.","def":"to mix up a message so it is hard to understand","cn":"使混亂不清；曲解","s":"The phone line was poor and his message was ________, so I could only understand a few words.","zh":"電話訊號很差，他的訊息斷斷續續聽不清楚，所以我只聽懂了幾個字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"斷斷續續聽不清楚"},{"w":"glamorise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem more attractive than it really is","cn":"美化；使有魅力","s":"Some films ________ smoking, so young viewers may think it looks cool rather than dangerous.","zh":"有些電影美化抽菸，所以年輕觀眾可能會覺得那很酷而不是危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"美化"},{"w":"hijack","pos":"v.","def":"to take control of something for your own purposes","cn":"劫持；挾持（議題）","s":"A small group ________ the online discussion about school lunches, and soon everyone was arguing about politics instead.","zh":"一小群人挾持了關於學校午餐的網路討論，很快大家都改成在吵政治。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"挾持"},{"w":"insinuate","pos":"v.","def":"to suggest something bad in an indirect way","cn":"暗示；影射","s":"The article ________ that the athlete had cheated, but it did not give any real evidence.","zh":"那篇文章暗示那位運動員作弊，但沒有提出任何真正的證據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"暗示"},{"w":"misconstrue","pos":"v.","def":"to understand something wrongly","cn":"誤解；曲解","s":"My friend ________ my joke as an insult, so I explained what I meant and apologised.","zh":"我朋友把我的玩笑誤解成侮辱，所以我解釋了我的意思並道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"誤解"},{"w":"misrepresent","pos":"v.","def":"to describe someone or something falsely","cn":"歪曲；不實地陳述","s":"The short clip ________ the scientist's views, because it left out the part where she explained her doubts.","zh":"那段短片歪曲了那位科學家的觀點，因為它刪掉了她解釋自己疑慮的部分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"歪曲"},{"w":"muddle","pos":"v.","def":"to mix things up and cause confusion","cn":"使混亂；弄混","s":"The two reports used different numbers, so they ________ readers who wanted to know the real cost.","zh":"兩份報告使用了不同的數字，所以讓想知道實際花費的讀者一頭霧水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"一頭霧水"},{"w":"obfuscate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something deliberately unclear","cn":"使模糊；混淆","s":"The contract used long, difficult words to ________ the hidden fees, so few customers noticed them.","zh":"那份合約使用又長又難的字來混淆隱藏費用，所以很少顧客注意到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"混淆"},{"w":"pander","pos":"v.","def":"to give people what they want even if it is wrong","cn":"迎合；討好","s":"Some websites ________ to readers' fears, because frightening stories get more clicks than calm ones.","zh":"有些網站迎合讀者的恐懼，因為嚇人的報導比冷靜的報導獲得更多點擊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"迎合"},{"w":"placate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone less angry","cn":"安撫；平息怒氣","s":"The manager offered free tickets to ________ the angry fans, but many still demanded a full refund.","zh":"經理提供免費門票來安撫憤怒的球迷，但許多人仍要求全額退款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"安撫"},{"w":"profess","pos":"v.","def":"to claim something, often falsely","cn":"聲稱；自稱","s":"He ________ to be an expert on health, but he had no medical training and his advice was dangerous.","zh":"他自稱是健康專家，但他沒有受過醫學訓練，他的建議很危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"自稱"},{"w":"relay","pos":"v.","def":"to pass a message from one person to another","cn":"轉達；轉播","s":"The teacher asked me to ________ the message to my classmates, because the school website was not working.","zh":"老師要我把訊息轉達給同學，因為學校網站故障了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"轉達"},{"w":"repudiate","pos":"v.","def":"to say officially that something is not true","cn":"駁斥；否認","s":"The scientist publicly ________ the claims made in the video, and she explained why they were wrong.","zh":"那位科學家公開駁斥影片中的說法，並解釋為什麼它們是錯的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"駁斥"},{"w":"silence","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from speaking or expressing opinions","cn":"使沉默；壓制","s":"The government tried to ________ critics by closing newspapers, but people continued to share news online.","zh":"政府試圖關閉報社來壓制批評者的聲音，但人們繼續在網路上分享新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"壓制"},{"w":"stigmatise","pos":"v.","def":"to treat a group of people as shameful","cn":"污名化","s":"News reports should not ________ people with mental illness, because this stops many of them from asking for help.","zh":"新聞報導不應該污名化有精神疾病的人，因為這會讓他們許多人不敢求助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"污名化"},{"w":"trivialise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something serious seem unimportant","cn":"輕忽；使顯得瑣碎","s":"The comedian's joke ________ the flood, so families who had lost their homes were deeply upset.","zh":"那位喜劇演員的笑話輕忽了水災的嚴重性，所以失去家園的家庭非常難過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"輕忽"},{"w":"undercut","pos":"v.","def":"to make something weaker or less effective","cn":"削弱；削價競爭","s":"The small mistakes in the report ________ its main argument, so readers began to doubt everything else in it.","zh":"報告中的小錯誤削弱了它的主要論點，所以讀者開始懷疑裡面的其他一切。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"削弱"},{"w":"unmask","pos":"v.","def":"to show the truth about someone who was hiding it","cn":"揭穿；揭露真面目","s":"Journalists ________ the person behind the fake charity, and the police arrested him a week later.","zh":"記者們揭穿了假慈善機構背後的人，警方一週後逮捕了他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"揭穿"},{"w":"vilify","pos":"v.","def":"to say very bad things about someone, often unfairly","cn":"詆毀；中傷","s":"Some newspapers ________ the young footballer after one mistake, but his team continued to support him.","zh":"有些報紙在那位年輕足球員失誤一次後就大肆抨擊他，但他的球隊仍然支持他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"大肆抨擊"},{"w":"vouch","pos":"v.","def":"to say that someone or something is good or true","cn":"擔保；保證","s":"I can ________ for this website, because I have used it for years and its information has always been accurate.","zh":"我可以擔保這個網站，因為我用了好幾年，它的資訊一直都很準確。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"擔保"},{"w":"belie","pos":"v.","def":"to give a false idea of something","cn":"掩飾；使人誤解","s":"Her calm voice ________ how nervous she really felt, so the audience thought she was very confident.","zh":"她平靜的聲音掩飾了她真實的緊張，所以觀眾以為她非常有自信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"掩飾了"},{"w":"curate","pos":"v.","def":"to choose and organise items for people to see","cn":"策劃；篩選整理","s":"The app ________ news from many sources, but it is still important to check who wrote each story.","zh":"那個應用程式篩選整理來自許多來源的新聞，但查看每則報導是誰寫的仍然很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"篩選整理"},{"w":"demonise","pos":"v.","def":"to describe a person or group as evil","cn":"妖魔化","s":"Politicians sometimes ________ their opponents to win votes, but this makes it harder for people to work together.","zh":"政治人物有時會妖魔化對手來贏得選票，但這會讓人們更難合作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"妖魔化"},{"w":"embolden","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone braver or more confident","cn":"使大膽；壯膽","s":"The large number of likes ________ him to post even ruder comments, so his friends finally told him to stop.","zh":"大量的按讚讓他更大膽，發了更無禮的留言，所以他的朋友終於叫他住手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"讓他更大膽"},{"w":"enthral","pos":"v.","def":"to hold someone's attention completely","cn":"使著迷；迷住","s":"The storyteller ________ the children with her tales of dragons, and nobody moved until the very end.","zh":"那位說故事的人用她的龍的故事迷住了孩子們，直到最後都沒有人動一下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"迷住"},{"w":"foment","pos":"v.","def":"to cause trouble or violence","cn":"煽動；挑起","s":"The fake posts were designed to ________ anger between the two groups, so police warned people not to share them.","zh":"那些假貼文旨在挑起兩個群體之間的憤怒，所以警方警告民眾不要分享。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"挑起"},{"w":"monetise","pos":"v.","def":"to earn money from something","cn":"使獲利；變現","s":"Many creators ________ their videos through adverts, but they need thousands of viewers before they earn much.","zh":"許多創作者透過廣告讓影片變現，但他們需要上千名觀眾才能賺到不少錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"變現"},{"w":"overhear","pos":"v.","def":"to hear something by accident","cn":"無意中聽到","s":"I ________ two students talking about the exam, but I soon realised that their information was wrong.","zh":"我無意中聽到兩個學生在討論考試，但我很快就發現他們的資訊是錯的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"無意中聽到"},{"w":"recant","pos":"v.","def":"to say publicly that you no longer believe something you said","cn":"公開撤回（說法）","s":"The witness ________ her story in court, so the journalists who had reported it had to publish corrections.","zh":"那位證人在法庭上撤回了她的說法，所以報導過的記者必須刊登更正。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"撤回"},{"w":"sabotage","pos":"v.","def":"to damage something on purpose to stop it working","cn":"蓄意破壞","s":"Someone ________ the school's website before the vote, so students could not see the candidates' speeches.","zh":"有人在投票前蓄意破壞了學校網站，所以學生看不到候選人的演講。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"蓄意破壞"},{"w":"subvert","pos":"v.","def":"to weaken a system or belief","cn":"顛覆；破壞","s":"False news can ________ democracy, because voters make choices based on information that is not true.","zh":"假新聞可能顛覆民主，因為選民根據不實的資訊做出選擇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"顛覆"},{"w":"summon","pos":"v.","def":"to officially order someone to come","cn":"傳喚；召集","s":"The editor was ________ to court after the newspaper published secret documents, but she said the public had a right to know.","zh":"報社刊登機密文件後，總編輯被傳喚出庭，但她說大眾有知的權利。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"傳喚"},{"w":"whitewash","pos":"v.","def":"to hide mistakes or bad facts","cn":"粉飾；掩蓋","s":"The report tried to ________ the company's safety problems, but workers later told reporters what had really happened.","zh":"那份報告試圖粉飾公司的安全問題，但員工後來告訴記者到底發生了什麼事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"粉飾"},{"w":"chastise","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise someone strongly","cn":"嚴厲斥責","s":"The coach ________ the players for posting rude comments online, and he made them apologise to the other team.","zh":"教練嚴厲斥責球員在網路上發布無禮留言，並要他們向對手道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"嚴厲斥責"},{"w":"coax","pos":"v.","def":"to gently persuade someone","cn":"哄勸；勸誘","s":"The reporter ________ the shy girl into telling her story, and her words touched thousands of viewers.","zh":"那位記者溫柔地勸那個害羞的女孩說出她的故事，而她的話感動了數千名觀眾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"溫柔地勸"},{"w":"infiltrate","pos":"v.","def":"to secretly join a group to get information","cn":"滲透；潛入","s":"The journalist ________ the fake news group by pretending to be a new member, and she recorded how they planned their posts.","zh":"那名記者假裝成新成員潛入了那個假新聞團體，並記錄下他們如何策劃貼文。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"潛入"},{"w":"orchestrate","pos":"v.","def":"to organise something carefully, often secretly","cn":"精心策劃；暗中安排","s":"The protest looked natural, but it was actually ________ by a company that wanted to stop the new law.","zh":"那場抗議看起來很自然，但其實是一家想阻止新法的公司精心策劃的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"精心策劃"},{"w":"perpetrate","pos":"v.","def":"to do something wrong or harmful","cn":"犯下（罪行）；做（壞事）","s":"The fraud was ________ by a group who sent fake messages from the bank, so many elderly people lost their savings.","zh":"那起詐騙是由一個冒充銀行發送假訊息的集團犯下的，所以許多老人失去了積蓄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"犯下"},{"w":"rebuke","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone sharply that they have done wrong","cn":"指責；訓斥","s":"The judge ________ the TV station for showing the victim's face, because it put her safety at risk.","zh":"法官訓斥那家電視台播出被害人的臉，因為這讓她的安全陷入危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"訓斥"},{"w":"reverberate","pos":"v.","def":"to have a strong effect that continues for a long time","cn":"產生持續影響；迴響","s":"The scandal ________ through the entertainment industry for months, and several other stars lost their sponsorship deals.","zh":"那起醜聞在娛樂圈持續發酵了好幾個月，其他幾位明星也失去了贊助合約。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"持續發酵"},{"w":"usurp","pos":"v.","def":"to take someone's position or power without the right","cn":"篡奪；奪取","s":"Online videos have ________ the role that television once played, so many young people never watch the evening news.","zh":"網路影片已經取代奪走了電視曾扮演的角色，所以許多年輕人從不看晚間新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"取代奪走"},{"w":"weaponise","pos":"v.","def":"to use something as a way to attack others","cn":"將…武器化","s":"Some groups ________ social media to attack journalists, and several reporters have had to close their accounts.","zh":"有些團體把社群媒體武器化來攻擊記者，好幾位記者不得不關閉帳號。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"武器化"},{"w":"woo","pos":"v.","def":"to try to get someone's support","cn":"爭取；拉攏","s":"Both candidates tried to ________ young voters with short videos, because they knew most students do not watch TV debates.","zh":"兩位候選人都試圖用短影片拉攏年輕選民，因為他們知道大多數學生不看電視辯論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"拉攏"},{"w":"admonish","pos":"v.","def":"to warn or criticise someone firmly","cn":"告誡；責備","s":"The teacher ________ the class for sharing a classmate's photo without permission, and she explained why it was harmful.","zh":"老師告誡全班未經同意就分享同學的照片，並解釋為什麼那是有害的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"告誡"},{"w":"blur","pos":"v.","def":"to make the difference between things less clear","cn":"使模糊；混淆界線","s":"Sponsored videos ________ the line between advice and advertising, so viewers may not realise they are being sold something.","zh":"業配影片模糊了建議和廣告之間的界線，所以觀眾可能沒發現有人在向他們推銷東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"模糊"},{"w":"capitulate","pos":"v.","def":"to stop resisting and agree to something","cn":"屈服；讓步","s":"The platform finally ________ to public pressure and removed the harmful videos, but critics said it had acted too slowly.","zh":"那個平台最終屈服於輿論壓力，刪除了有害影片，但批評者說它行動太慢了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"屈服"},{"w":"collude","pos":"v.","def":"to work together secretly to cheat others","cn":"勾結；串通","s":"The two companies ________ to keep prices high, but a journalist found their emails and reported the story.","zh":"那兩家公司串通維持高價，但一名記者找到了他們的電子郵件並報導了此事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"串通"},{"w":"conflate","pos":"v.","def":"to wrongly treat two different things as the same","cn":"混為一談","s":"Many people ________ opinion with fact, so they believe that a strong feeling must also be true.","zh":"許多人把意見和事實混為一談，所以他們相信強烈的感覺也一定是真的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"混為一談"},{"w":"defuse","pos":"v.","def":"to make a tense situation calmer","cn":"緩和；化解","s":"The teacher ________ the argument by asking both students to explain their views calmly, and soon they were laughing.","zh":"老師請兩位學生冷靜地說明各自的觀點來化解爭吵，很快他們就笑了起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"化解"},{"w":"delude","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone believe something that is not true","cn":"欺騙；使誤信","s":"Don't ________ yourself that you can study well while watching videos, because your brain cannot focus on both.","zh":"別欺騙自己說你能邊看影片邊好好讀書，因為你的大腦無法同時專注兩件事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"欺騙"},{"w":"emanate","pos":"v.","def":"to come from a particular source","cn":"發出；源自","s":"The rumour seemed to ________ from a single anonymous account, but it soon spread to thousands of users.","zh":"那則謠言似乎源自一個匿名帳號，但很快就傳到了數千名使用者那裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"源自"},{"w":"enunciate","pos":"v.","def":"to say words clearly","cn":"清楚地發音","s":"Good news presenters ________ every word, so even viewers with poor hearing can follow the news.","zh":"好的新聞主播會把每個字咬字清楚，所以即使聽力不好的觀眾也能聽懂新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"咬字清楚"},{"w":"eschew","pos":"v.","def":"to avoid something on purpose","cn":"刻意避開；避免","s":"The newspaper ________ celebrity gossip, because it wants to focus on serious local and international news.","zh":"那份報紙刻意避開名人八卦，因為它想專注於嚴肅的地方和國際新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"刻意避開"},{"w":"exonerate","pos":"v.","def":"to show officially that someone is not guilty","cn":"證明無罪；洗清罪名","s":"New video evidence ________ the young man, but by then his photo had already been shared as a \"criminal\" online.","zh":"新的影片證據證明那位年輕人無罪，但那時他的照片早已被當作「罪犯」在網路上流傳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"證明"},{"w":"feign","pos":"v.","def":"to pretend to feel something","cn":"假裝","s":"He ________ surprise when he saw the results, but he had already read them online that morning.","zh":"他看到結果時假裝驚訝，但他那天早上已經在網路上看過了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"假裝"},{"w":"flout","pos":"v.","def":"to break a rule openly","cn":"公然違反","s":"Some influencers ________ advertising rules by hiding paid posts, so the government is planning heavier fines.","zh":"有些網紅藉由隱瞞業配貼文公然違反廣告規定，所以政府打算加重罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"公然違反"},{"w":"interject","pos":"v.","def":"to interrupt with a comment","cn":"插話；插嘴","s":"During the debate one student kept trying to ________, so the teacher reminded everyone to wait for their turn.","zh":"辯論時有位學生一直想插話，所以老師提醒大家等輪到自己再說。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"插話"},{"w":"lambast","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise someone very strongly","cn":"嚴厲抨擊","s":"Critics ________ the film for its poor acting, but audiences loved it and it earned a lot of money.","zh":"影評人嚴厲抨擊那部電影演技很差，但觀眾很喜歡，它賺了很多錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"嚴厲抨擊"},{"w":"languish","pos":"v.","def":"to stay in a bad situation for a long time","cn":"受困；被冷落","s":"The important report ________ on the minister's desk for months, so the public never learned about the problems in time.","zh":"那份重要報告在部長桌上被冷落了好幾個月，所以大眾沒能及時得知那些問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"被冷落"},{"w":"shroud","pos":"v.","def":"to cover or hide something","cn":"籠罩；隱藏","s":"The cause of the accident remains ________ in mystery, because the company refuses to release the video.","zh":"那起事故的原因仍籠罩在謎團中，因為公司拒絕公開影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"籠罩"},{"w":"malign","pos":"v.","def":"to say unfair and harmful things about someone","cn":"中傷；誹謗","s":"The actress said she had been ________ by fake stories, and she asked her fans to stop sharing them.","zh":"那位女演員說她被假新聞中傷，並請粉絲不要再分享。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"中傷"},{"w":"muster","pos":"v.","def":"to gather courage, strength or support","cn":"鼓起（勇氣）；召集","s":"She finally ________ the courage to report the cyberbullying, and the school took action the same day.","zh":"她終於鼓起勇氣舉報網路霸凌，學校當天就採取了行動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"鼓起"},{"w":"pacify","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone calm","cn":"使平靜；安撫","s":"The mother tried to ________ her crying baby with a song, but the noise on the train made it very difficult.","zh":"那位母親試著用一首歌安撫哭鬧的寶寶，但火車上的噪音讓這件事變得很困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"安撫"},{"w":"quash","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from continuing","cn":"平息；壓制","s":"The company quickly posted a video to ________ the rumours about closing, and its share price rose the next day.","zh":"那家公司很快發布影片來平息關於倒閉的謠言，隔天股價就上漲了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"平息"},{"w":"ramble","pos":"v.","def":"to talk for a long time in a confused way","cn":"漫無邊際地閒扯","s":"The speaker ________ for twenty minutes without making a clear point, so half the audience started checking their phones.","zh":"那位講者東拉西扯了二十分鐘卻沒講出重點，所以一半的聽眾開始看手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"東拉西扯"},{"w":"retort","pos":"v.","def":"to reply quickly and angrily","cn":"反駁；回嘴","s":"When the reporter asked about the mistake, the coach ________ that the referee was to blame, and he walked away.","zh":"記者問到那個失誤時，教練反駁說是裁判的錯，然後就走開了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"反駁"},{"w":"stymie","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from making progress","cn":"阻礙；使受挫","s":"Slow internet ________ the students' research, so the teacher gave them extra time to finish the project.","zh":"網路太慢阻礙了學生的研究，所以老師給他們額外的時間完成專題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"阻礙"},{"w":"waver","pos":"v.","def":"to be unable to decide; to become less certain","cn":"動搖；猶豫不決","s":"Her support for the plan began to ________ after she read the critics' arguments, so she asked for more information.","zh":"讀了批評者的論點後，她對該計畫的支持開始動搖，所以她要求更多資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"動搖"},{"w":"understate","pos":"v.","def":"to describe something as smaller than it really is","cn":"輕描淡寫；少報","s":"The official report ________ the number of people affected by the flood, so less help was sent than was needed.","zh":"官方報告少報了受水災影響的人數，所以送去的援助比需要的少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"少報"},{"w":"romanticise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem better than it really is","cn":"浪漫化；理想化","s":"Many films ________ life in big cities, but in reality young workers often struggle with high rent and long hours.","zh":"許多電影美化大城市的生活，但現實中年輕上班族常為高房租和長工時所苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"美化"},{"w":"scapegoat","pos":"v.","def":"to blame someone unfairly for others' mistakes","cn":"使成為代罪羔羊","s":"The company ________ a junior employee for the data leak, although managers had ignored the warnings for months.","zh":"公司讓一名基層員工當代罪羔羊承擔資料外洩的責任，儘管主管們已忽視警告好幾個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"當代罪羔羊"},{"w":"incriminate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone seem guilty","cn":"使顯得有罪；牽連","s":"The messages on his phone ________ him, because they showed that he had planned the fake reviews.","zh":"他手機裡的訊息顯示他有罪，因為那些訊息證明他策劃了假評論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"顯示他有罪"},{"w":"insist","pos":"v.","def":"to say firmly that something is true or must happen","cn":"堅持；堅稱","s":"The influencer ________ that the photos were not edited, but experts showed clear signs that they had been changed.","zh":"那位網紅堅稱照片沒有修過，但專家指出了明顯被修改的跡象。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"堅稱"},{"w":"declare","pos":"v.","def":"to state something officially or clearly","cn":"宣布；聲明","s":"The organisers ________ the event a success, although many people complained about the long queues.","zh":"主辦單位宣布活動很成功，儘管許多人抱怨排隊太久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"宣布"},{"w":"utter","pos":"v.","def":"to say something","cn":"說出；發出（聲音）","s":"He did not ________ a single word during the meeting, so his manager later asked whether he disagreed with the plan.","zh":"他在會議中一個字都沒說，所以經理後來問他是否不同意這個計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"說"},{"w":"voice","pos":"v.","def":"to express an opinion or feeling","cn":"表達；說出","s":"Several worried parents ________ concerns about the new app, because it secretly collected children's location data.","zh":"好幾位憂心的家長表達了對那個新應用程式的擔憂，因為它偷偷收集孩子的位置資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"表達"},{"w":"muzzle","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from speaking freely","cn":"封口；壓制言論","s":"The new law could ________ the press, because journalists may be fined for reporting on government mistakes.","zh":"新法可能會封住媒體的口，因為記者可能因報導政府的錯誤而被罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"封住媒體的口"},{"w":"confess","pos":"v.","def":"to admit that you did something wrong","cn":"承認；坦白","s":"The student ________ that he had copied the essay from a website, so the teacher let him write it again.","zh":"那位學生坦承他從網站上抄了那篇作文，所以老師讓他重寫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"坦承"},{"w":"accusatory","pos":"adj.","def":"suggesting that someone has done wrong","cn":"指責的；控訴的","s":"The comment sounded ________, so my friend felt hurt even though I had only asked a simple question.","zh":"那句留言聽起來帶有指責的意味，所以即使我只是問了個簡單的問題，我朋友還是覺得受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"指責的"},{"w":"adamant","pos":"adj.","def":"refusing to change your opinion","cn":"堅定不移的；堅持的","s":"The author was ________ that the story was true, but she could not provide any documents to prove it.","zh":"那位作者堅稱那個故事是真的，但她提不出任何文件來證明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"堅稱"},{"w":"alarmist","pos":"adj.","def":"making people worried without good reason","cn":"危言聳聽的","s":"The ________ headline said that all phones cause cancer, but the study it described was very small and uncertain.","zh":"那個危言聳聽的標題說所有手機都會致癌，但它所描述的研究規模很小又不確定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"危言聳聽的"},{"w":"complicit","pos":"adj.","def":"involved with others in doing something wrong","cn":"共謀的；有共犯責任的","s":"By sharing the cruel video, many users became ________ in the bullying, although they did not create it.","zh":"許多使用者分享那段殘忍的影片，雖然不是他們拍的，卻也成了霸凌的共犯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"共犯"},{"w":"culpable","pos":"adj.","def":"deserving blame","cn":"應受責備的；有罪責的","s":"The court found the website ________ for the damage, because it had published the false story without checking.","zh":"法院判定那個網站對損害負有責任，因為它未經查證就刊登了不實報導。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"負有責任"},{"w":"deceitful","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to make people believe things that are false","cn":"欺詐的；不誠實的","s":"The ________ seller used photos of a different house, so the family was shocked when they saw the real one.","zh":"那個不誠實的賣家使用了另一棟房子的照片，所以那家人看到真正的房子時大吃一驚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"不誠實的"},{"w":"derogatory","pos":"adj.","def":"showing a very poor opinion of someone","cn":"貶損的；不敬的","s":"The player used a ________ word about his opponent, and the league banned him for three matches.","zh":"那名球員對對手使用了貶損的字眼，聯盟禁賽他三場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"貶損的"},{"w":"disingenuous","pos":"adj.","def":"pretending to be honest when you are not","cn":"不真誠的；虛偽的","s":"It is ________ to say the advert is \"just information\", because the company clearly wants to sell its product.","zh":"說那則廣告「只是資訊」是不真誠的，因為那家公司顯然想賣它的產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"不真誠的"},{"w":"dismissive","pos":"adj.","def":"showing that you think something is not important","cn":"輕蔑的；不屑一顧的","s":"The manager was ________ of the customer's complaint, so she posted a long review online that many people read.","zh":"經理對顧客的投訴不屑一顧，所以她在網路上發表了一篇很多人讀的長篇評論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"不屑一顧"},{"w":"emotive","pos":"adj.","def":"causing strong feelings","cn":"引起強烈情感的","s":"The charity used ________ pictures of hungry children, and donations increased sharply within a week.","zh":"那個慈善機構使用了飢餓兒童的觸動情感的照片，一週內捐款大幅增加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"觸動情感的"},{"w":"factual","pos":"adj.","def":"based on facts, not opinions","cn":"根據事實的；事實性的","s":"The report contained several ________ errors, so the newspaper had to correct the dates and names the next day.","zh":"那篇報導有好幾處事實錯誤，所以報社隔天必須更正日期和人名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"事實"},{"w":"far-fetched","pos":"adj.","def":"very unlikely to be true","cn":"牽強的；難以置信的","s":"His explanation sounded ________, because nobody believes that a dog could really eat a whole laptop.","zh":"他的解釋聽起來很牽強，因為沒有人相信一隻狗真的能吃掉一整台筆電。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"牽強"},{"w":"fictitious","pos":"adj.","def":"invented and not real","cn":"虛構的；捏造的","s":"The website used ________ names for its \"doctors\", so none of them could be found in any medical records.","zh":"那個網站為它的「醫生」使用虛構的名字，所以在任何醫療紀錄中都找不到他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"虛構的"},{"w":"forthright","pos":"adj.","def":"saying clearly and honestly what you think","cn":"坦率的；直言不諱的","s":"The new principal is ________ about the school's problems, and parents appreciate that she does not hide bad news.","zh":"新校長對學校的問題直言不諱，家長們很欣賞她不隱瞞壞消息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"直言不諱"},{"w":"gratuitous","pos":"adj.","def":"not necessary and often harmful","cn":"不必要的；無端的","s":"The film was full of ________ violence, so many parents decided it was not suitable for their children.","zh":"那部電影充滿不必要的暴力，所以許多家長認為它不適合孩子看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"不必要的"},{"w":"groundless","pos":"adj.","def":"not based on facts or reasons","cn":"毫無根據的","s":"The fears about the new phone tower were ________, but the rumours spread quickly in the village anyway.","zh":"對新基地台的恐懼是毫無根據的，但謠言還是在村子裡迅速散播開來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"毫無根據的"},{"w":"ill-informed","pos":"adj.","def":"having wrong or too little information","cn":"消息不靈通的；無知的","s":"Many ________ comments appeared under the article, because people reacted to the headline without reading the story.","zh":"文章下方出現許多不了解狀況的留言，因為人們沒讀內容就對標題做出反應。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"不了解狀況的"},{"w":"impressionable","pos":"adj.","def":"easily influenced by others","cn":"易受影響的","s":"Young children are very ________, so they may copy dangerous stunts they see in online videos.","zh":"年幼的孩子很容易受影響，所以他們可能會模仿網路影片中看到的危險特技。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"容易受影響"},{"w":"incontrovertible","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to argue against","cn":"無可辯駁的；不容置疑的","s":"The video gave ________ proof that the driver had run the red light, so he finally admitted his mistake.","zh":"那段影片提供了無可辯駁的證據，證明司機闖了紅燈，所以他終於承認錯誤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"無可辯駁的"},{"w":"indignant","pos":"adj.","def":"angry because something seems unfair","cn":"憤慨的；義憤填膺的","s":"The students were ________ when the school cancelled their trip without explanation, so they wrote a letter to the principal.","zh":"學校無故取消他們的旅行時，學生們憤憤不平，所以他們寫了一封信給校長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"憤憤不平"},{"w":"informative","pos":"adj.","def":"giving useful information","cn":"有益的；資訊豐富的","s":"The museum's website is very ________, and it helped me find all the facts I needed for my history project.","zh":"博物館的網站資訊非常豐富，它幫我找到歷史專題所需的所有資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"資訊 豐富"},{"w":"jaded","pos":"adj.","def":"bored or tired because you have seen too much of something","cn":"厭倦的；麻木的","s":"After years of political scandals, many voters feel ________, so they no longer pay attention to the news.","zh":"經過多年的政治醜聞，許多選民感到麻木厭倦，所以他們不再關注新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"麻木厭倦"},{"w":"lurid","pos":"adj.","def":"shocking and full of unpleasant details","cn":"駭人聽聞的；聳動的","s":"The magazine printed ________ details about the crime, but the victim's family said this caused them great pain.","zh":"那本雜誌刊登了犯罪案駭人聽聞的細節，但被害人家屬說這讓他們非常痛苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"駭人聽聞的"},{"w":"one-sided","pos":"adj.","def":"showing only one point of view","cn":"片面的；一面倒的","s":"The documentary was ________, because it interviewed only the factory owners and none of the local farmers.","zh":"那部紀錄片很片面，因為它只採訪了工廠老闆，沒有採訪任何當地農民。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"片面"},{"w":"opinionated","pos":"adj.","def":"having strong views and expressing them too often","cn":"固執己見的","s":"My uncle is very ________ about politics, so family dinners often end in loud arguments.","zh":"我叔叔對政治非常固執己見，所以家庭聚餐常以大聲爭吵收場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"固執己見"},{"w":"outspoken","pos":"adj.","def":"saying exactly what you think in public","cn":"直言不諱的；敢言的","s":"The ________ student spoke against the new rule at the meeting, and many classmates later thanked her for her courage.","zh":"那位敢言的學生在會議上反對新規定，後來許多同學感謝她的勇氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"敢言的"},{"w":"pejorative","pos":"adj.","def":"expressing disapproval or a low opinion","cn":"貶義的","s":"\"Nerd\" was once a ________ word, but today many young people use it proudly to describe themselves.","zh":"「書呆子」曾經是一個貶義的字，但如今許多年輕人驕傲地用它來形容自己。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"貶義的"},{"w":"populist","pos":"adj.","def":"claiming to support ordinary people against the elite","cn":"民粹主義的","s":"The ________ leader promised simple solutions to complex problems, and many frustrated voters liked his message.","zh":"那位民粹主義的領袖承諾用簡單的方法解決複雜的問題，許多不滿的選民喜歡他的訴求。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"民粹主義的"},{"w":"pretentious","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to seem more important or clever than you are","cn":"自命不凡的；做作的","s":"The review was full of long, ________ words, so most readers could not understand whether the critic liked the film.","zh":"那篇影評充滿又長又做作的字眼，所以大多數讀者看不懂影評人到底喜不喜歡那部電影。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"做作的"},{"w":"salacious","pos":"adj.","def":"containing too much interest in sexual or shocking details","cn":"淫穢的；低俗煽情的","s":"Cheap tabloids often print ________ stories about celebrities, because such stories usually sell many more copies.","zh":"廉價小報常刊登關於名人的低俗煽情的報導，因為這類報導通常賣得好得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"低俗煽情的"},{"w":"scathing","pos":"adj.","def":"criticising very strongly","cn":"尖刻的；嚴厲的","s":"The critic wrote a ________ review of the restaurant, and within a month the owner had changed the whole menu.","zh":"那位評論家寫了一篇尖刻的餐廳評論，一個月內老闆就換掉了整份菜單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"尖刻的"},{"w":"self-serving","pos":"adj.","def":"done mainly to help yourself","cn":"自私自利的；為自己打算的","s":"The company's apology seemed ________, because it spent more time praising its products than helping the victims.","zh":"那家公司的道歉似乎是在為自己打算，因為它花在稱讚產品的時間比幫助受害者還多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"為自己打算"},{"w":"trite","pos":"adj.","def":"used so often that it is no longer interesting","cn":"陳腐的；老套的","s":"Her speech was full of ________ phrases like \"follow your dreams\", so the audience soon lost interest.","zh":"她的演講充滿像「追隨你的夢想」這樣老套的句子，所以聽眾很快就失去興趣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"老套的"},{"w":"truthful","pos":"adj.","def":"honest and telling the truth","cn":"誠實的；真實的","s":"Please be ________ in your survey answers, because the results will help the school improve its services.","zh":"請誠實回答問卷，因為結果將幫助學校改善服務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"誠實"},{"w":"vocal","pos":"adj.","def":"expressing opinions strongly and publicly","cn":"直言的；大聲疾呼的","s":"Parents have been very ________ about the dangers of the busy road, and the city has finally agreed to add a crossing.","zh":"家長們對那條繁忙道路的危險一直大聲疾呼，市政府終於同意增設行人穿越道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"大聲疾呼"},{"w":"vociferous","pos":"adj.","def":"expressing opinions loudly and forcefully","cn":"大聲疾呼的；喧嚷的","s":"The plan faced ________ opposition from local residents, so the council decided to hold another public meeting.","zh":"該計畫遭到當地居民強烈反對，所以議會決定再舉行一次公聽會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"強烈"},{"w":"watertight","pos":"adj.","def":"so strong it cannot be questioned","cn":"無懈可擊的；嚴密的","s":"The lawyer's argument seemed ________, but the journalist found one small mistake that changed everything.","zh":"那位律師的論點看似無懈可擊，但那名記者找到一個改變一切的小錯誤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"無懈可擊"},{"w":"wilful","pos":"adj.","def":"done on purpose, knowing it is wrong","cn":"蓄意的；故意的","s":"Sharing a story you know is false is ________ deception, so it is much worse than making an honest mistake.","zh":"分享你明知是假的消息是蓄意的欺騙，所以比無心之過嚴重得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"蓄意的"},{"w":"offensive","pos":"adj.","def":"rude in a way that upsets people","cn":"冒犯的；無禮的","s":"The joke was ________ to many people, so the comedian apologised and removed the video from his channel.","zh":"那個笑話冒犯了許多人，所以那位喜劇演員道歉並從他的頻道上撤下影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"冒犯"},{"w":"outlandish","pos":"adj.","def":"very strange and unusual","cn":"古怪的；荒誕的","s":"The website made ________ claims about a fruit that could cure every disease, but no scientist supported them.","zh":"那個網站對一種能治百病的水果做出荒誕的說法，但沒有科學家支持。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"荒誕的"},{"w":"preposterous","pos":"adj.","def":"completely unreasonable or silly","cn":"荒謬的；可笑的","s":"The idea that the earth is flat is ________, but some videos promoting it still get millions of views.","zh":"地球是平的這個想法很荒謬，但一些宣揚它的影片仍然獲得數百萬次觀看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"荒謬"},{"w":"ludicrous","pos":"adj.","def":"so silly that it makes people laugh","cn":"荒唐可笑的","s":"The price of the concert tickets was ________, so many fans decided to watch the livestream instead.","zh":"演唱會門票的價格貴得離譜，所以許多粉絲決定改看直播。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"貴得離譜"},{"w":"suspicious","pos":"adj.","def":"making you think something is wrong","cn":"可疑的；令人懷疑的","s":"I received a ________ email asking for my bank password, so I deleted it and reported it to the bank.","zh":"我收到一封要我提供銀行密碼的可疑電子郵件，所以我刪除了它並通報銀行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"可疑"},{"w":"topical","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to things happening now","cn":"時事性的；熱門話題的","s":"Our English teacher likes to discuss ________ issues in class, so we often read news articles from the same week.","zh":"我們的英文老師喜歡在課堂上討論時事議題，所以我們常讀同一週的新聞報導。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"時事"},{"w":"long-winded","pos":"adj.","def":"too long and boring","cn":"冗長的；囉嗦的","s":"The manager's ________ email took ten minutes to read, but the main point could have been written in two sentences.","zh":"經理那封冗長的電子郵件要花十分鐘才讀完，但重點其實兩句話就能寫完。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"冗長的"},{"w":"figurative","pos":"adj.","def":"not using words in their basic meaning","cn":"比喻的；象徵的","s":"\"A sea of faces\" is a ________ expression, so it does not mean that the people were actually in water.","zh":"「一片人海」是比喻的說法，所以並不是指人們真的在水裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"比喻的"},{"w":"metaphor","pos":"n.","def":"describing something by calling it something else","cn":"隱喻；暗喻","s":"The writer used the ________ of a storm to describe the online anger, and readers found the image very powerful.","zh":"作者用暴風雨的隱喻來描述網路上的怒火，讀者覺得這個意象非常有力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"隱喻"},{"w":"buzzword","pos":"n.","def":"a fashionable word that becomes very popular","cn":"流行術語；時髦用語","s":"\"Sustainable\" has become a ________ in advertising, but many companies use it without changing how they work.","zh":"「永續」已成為廣告中的流行術語，但許多公司使用它卻沒有改變做事的方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"流行術語"},{"w":"oratory","pos":"n.","def":"the skill of making powerful public speeches","cn":"演說技巧；雄辯術","s":"The leader was famous for his ________, and his speeches made crowds cheer even when his ideas were unclear.","zh":"那位領袖以他的演說技巧聞名，即使他的想法不清楚，他的演講也能讓群眾歡呼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"演說技巧"},{"w":"outreach","pos":"n.","def":"efforts to give help or information to people","cn":"推廣服務；外展活動","s":"The library runs an ________ programme in poor areas, so children without books at home can still read every week.","zh":"圖書館在貧困地區舉辦外展推廣計畫，所以家裡沒有書的孩子每週仍能閱讀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"外展推廣"},{"w":"dossier","pos":"n.","def":"a set of documents about a person or event","cn":"檔案；卷宗","s":"The journalist collected a thick ________ on the company's pollution, and she handed it to the police.","zh":"那名記者蒐集了一份關於該公司汙染的厚厚卷宗，並將它交給警方。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"卷宗"},{"w":"communiqué","pos":"n.","def":"an official statement, especially after a meeting","cn":"公報；官方聲明","s":"The leaders released a joint ________ after the summit, but it contained few clear promises.","zh":"領袖們在高峰會後發表了聯合公報，但內容幾乎沒有明確的承諾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"公報"},{"w":"manifesto","pos":"n.","def":"a written statement of a group's aims and beliefs","cn":"宣言；政見","s":"The party's ________ promised free school lunches, so many families decided to vote for it.","zh":"該黨的政見承諾提供免費學校午餐，所以許多家庭決定投票給它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"政見"},{"w":"treatise","pos":"n.","def":"a long, serious piece of writing on a subject","cn":"專著；論文","s":"The professor wrote a ________ on the history of newspapers, and it is still used in universities today.","zh":"那位教授寫了一本關於報紙歷史的專著，至今仍在大學裡使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"專著"},{"w":"anthology","pos":"n.","def":"a book of works by different writers","cn":"選集；文集","s":"Our teacher gave us an ________ of short stories, and each one was written by a writer from a different country.","zh":"老師給了我們一本短篇小說選集，每篇都是由不同國家的作家寫的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"選集"},{"w":"soundbite","pos":"n.","def":"a short, memorable phrase taken from a longer speech","cn":"（新聞中引用的）精簡名句；原音片段","s":"The news only showed one ________ from her speech, so viewers missed the important details she explained later.","zh":"新聞只播了她演講中的一句原音片段，所以觀眾錯過了她後來解釋的重要細節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"原音片段"},{"w":"barrage","pos":"n.","def":"a large number of things coming at once","cn":"接二連三的一大堆；連珠砲","s":"The singer faced a ________ of questions from reporters, but she smiled and answered them one by one.","zh":"那位歌手面對記者連珠砲似的提問，但她微笑著一一回答。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"連珠砲"},{"w":"torrent","pos":"n.","def":"a large amount of something arriving suddenly","cn":"洪流；大量湧現","s":"After the video went viral, he received a ________ of messages, and he needed several days to read them all.","zh":"影片爆紅後，他收到了如潮水般的訊息，花了好幾天才全部讀完。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"如潮水般的"},{"w":"glimpse","pos":"n.","def":"a quick look or short experience of something","cn":"一瞥；短暫的體驗","s":"The documentary gives us a ________ of life inside a newsroom, and it shows how stressful the job can be.","zh":"那部紀錄片讓我們一窺新聞編輯室內的生活，也呈現出這份工作有多大的壓力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"一窺"},{"w":"snippet","pos":"n.","def":"a small piece of information or conversation","cn":"片段；零星資訊","s":"I only heard a ________ of their conversation, so I should not have told everyone what I thought they meant.","zh":"我只聽到他們對話的一小片段，所以我不該把我以為的意思告訴大家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"片段"},{"w":"allegation","pos":"n.","def":"a claim that someone did something wrong, without proof yet","cn":"指控；（未經證實的）說法","s":"The newspaper reported the ________ against the coach, but it made clear that nothing had been proved.","zh":"報紙報導了對那位教練的指控，但清楚表明一切尚未獲得證實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"指控"},{"w":"blunder","pos":"n.","def":"a careless and embarrassing mistake","cn":"大錯；愚蠢的失誤","s":"The TV station made a big ________ when it showed the wrong winner, and the clip was shared all over the internet.","zh":"那家電視台公布錯誤得獎者，犯下了大錯，那段畫面在網路上瘋傳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"大錯"},{"w":"bombardment","pos":"n.","def":"a very large number of things directed at someone","cn":"轟炸；大量湧入","s":"Children face a constant ________ of adverts online, so it is hard for them to know what they really need.","zh":"孩子們在網路上不斷受到廣告轟炸，所以他們很難知道自己真正需要什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"轟炸"},{"w":"caricature","pos":"n.","def":"a drawing or description that exaggerates features for humour","cn":"諷刺漫畫；誇張描繪","s":"The cartoonist drew a ________ of the president with huge ears, and it appeared on the front of the magazine.","zh":"那位漫畫家畫了一幅總統長著大耳朵的諷刺漫畫，它出現在雜誌封面上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"諷刺漫畫"},{"w":"cliché","pos":"n.","def":"an idea or phrase used so often it is no longer interesting","cn":"陳腔濫調","s":"\"Time flies\" is a ________, so my teacher told me to find a more original way to start my essay.","zh":"「光陰似箭」是陳腔濫調，所以老師要我找一個更有新意的方式來開頭作文。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"陳腔濫調"},{"w":"counterclaim","pos":"n.","def":"a claim made to oppose another claim","cn":"反訴；反駁的主張","s":"A good essay mentions a ________ and then answers it, because this shows that the writer understands both sides.","zh":"好的論說文會提出反方主張再加以回應，因為這表示作者了解正反兩面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"反方主張"},{"w":"demagogue","pos":"n.","def":"a leader who wins support by using people's emotions and fears","cn":"煽動群眾的政客","s":"The ________ blamed foreigners for every problem in the country, and his angry speeches attracted large crowds.","zh":"那個煽動家把國內的每個問題都歸咎於外國人，他憤怒的演說吸引了大批群眾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"煽動家"},{"w":"detractor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who criticises someone or something","cn":"批評者；貶低者","s":"The new app has many fans, but its ________ say that it collects too much personal data.","zh":"那款新應用程式有很多粉絲，但批評者說它收集太多個人資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"批評者"},{"w":"euphemism","pos":"n.","def":"a polite word used instead of an unpleasant one","cn":"委婉語","s":"\"Letting staff go\" is a ________ for firing people, and the workers were not fooled by the gentle language.","zh":"「讓員工離開」是解僱的委婉說法，員工們並沒有被這種溫和的措辭騙到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"委婉說法"},{"w":"fanfare","pos":"n.","def":"a lot of public attention and celebration","cn":"大肆宣傳；熱烈慶祝","s":"The new phone was launched with great ________, but after a few weeks many buyers complained about the battery.","zh":"那款新手機在大張旗鼓中上市，但幾週後許多買家抱怨電池問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"大張旗鼓"},{"w":"frenzy","pos":"n.","def":"a state of wild excitement","cn":"狂熱；瘋狂","s":"The rumour of a celebrity wedding caused a media ________, and reporters surrounded the hotel for two days.","zh":"名人婚禮的傳聞引發了媒體狂熱，記者們包圍那家飯店兩天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"狂熱"},{"w":"furore","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden expression of public anger","cn":"騷動；公憤","s":"The decision to cancel the festival caused a ________ online, so the organisers changed their minds the next day.","zh":"取消音樂節的決定在網路上引起軒然大波，所以主辦單位隔天就改變了主意。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"軒然大波"},{"w":"gaffe","pos":"n.","def":"an embarrassing mistake in a social situation","cn":"失言；出糗","s":"The minister made a ________ when he forgot the name of the city he was visiting, and the video spread quickly.","zh":"部長忘了他正在訪問的城市名稱而失言出糗，那段影片迅速傳開。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"失言出糗"},{"w":"hyperbole","pos":"n.","def":"a way of speaking that exaggerates a lot","cn":"誇飾；誇張法","s":"Saying \"I've told you a million times\" is ________, because nobody really repeats something a million times.","zh":"說「我已經跟你講一百萬次了」是一種誇飾，因為沒有人真的會重複一件事一百萬次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"誇飾"},{"w":"hypocrisy","pos":"n.","def":"saying one thing but doing the opposite","cn":"虛偽；偽善","s":"People criticised the ________ of the star, because he talked about saving the planet but flew in a private jet every week.","zh":"人們批評那位明星的虛偽，因為他談論拯救地球，卻每週搭私人飛機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"虛偽"},{"w":"innuendo","pos":"n.","def":"an indirect remark suggesting something bad","cn":"含沙射影的話；影射","s":"The article used ________ rather than facts, so readers were left thinking the teacher had done something wrong.","zh":"那篇文章用含沙射影而非事實，所以讀者以為那位老師做了什麼錯事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"含沙射影"},{"w":"misnomer","pos":"n.","def":"a name that does not describe something correctly","cn":"用詞不當；名不副實","s":"\"Social media\" can be a ________, because many people feel more lonely after using it for hours.","zh":"「社群媒體」可能是個名不副實的說法，因為許多人用了幾個小時後反而更覺得孤單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"名不副實的說法"},{"w":"platitude","pos":"n.","def":"a statement that is too obvious and often used","cn":"陳腔濫調；老生常談","s":"The company replied with a ________ about \"valuing our customers\", but it did nothing to solve the problem.","zh":"那家公司用「重視我們的顧客」這種老生常談回應，卻沒有做任何事來解決問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"老生常談"},{"w":"polemic","pos":"n.","def":"a strong written or spoken attack on an idea","cn":"論戰文章；猛烈抨擊","s":"His book is a ________ against social media, so it does not discuss the benefits that many users enjoy.","zh":"他的書是一篇對社群媒體的猛烈抨擊，所以它沒有討論許多使用者享受到的好處。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"猛烈抨擊"},{"w":"sarcasm","pos":"n.","def":"saying the opposite of what you mean to mock someone","cn":"諷刺；挖苦","s":"________ is hard to understand in text messages, so my friend thought I was serious when I was only joking.","zh":"反諷在簡訊中很難被理解，所以我只是開玩笑時，我朋友卻以為我是認真的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"反諷"},{"w":"scandal","pos":"n.","def":"an event that shocks the public because it is wrong","cn":"醜聞","s":"The ________ began when a journalist discovered that the charity had spent donations on luxury cars.","zh":"那起醜聞始於一名記者發現該慈善機構把捐款花在豪華汽車上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"醜聞"},{"w":"semblance","pos":"n.","def":"a situation that looks like something but may not be","cn":"表象；外觀","s":"After the fire, the town slowly returned to some ________ of normal life, and the local paper reopened its office.","zh":"火災後，小鎮慢慢恢復了一些正常生活的樣貌，地方報社也重新開張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"樣貌"},{"w":"spectacle","pos":"n.","def":"an event that is exciting or shocking to watch","cn":"奇觀；引人注目的場面","s":"The trial became a media ________, and cameras followed the famous singer every time she left the court.","zh":"那場審判成了一場媒體奇觀，每次那位知名歌手離開法院時，鏡頭都緊追著她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"奇觀"},{"w":"subtext","pos":"n.","def":"a hidden meaning that is not stated directly","cn":"潛台詞；言外之意","s":"The ________ of the advert was that you would be unpopular without the product, so many parents found it unhealthy.","zh":"那則廣告的言外之意是沒有這項產品你就不受歡迎，所以許多家長覺得它不健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"言外之意"},{"w":"tirade","pos":"n.","def":"a long, angry speech criticising someone","cn":"激烈的長篇抨擊","s":"The customer posted a long ________ about the hotel, but the manager replied calmly and offered a refund.","zh":"那位顧客發了一篇針對飯店的長篇怒罵，但經理冷靜回應並提出退款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"長篇怒罵"},{"w":"uproar","pos":"n.","def":"a lot of public anger or noisy protest","cn":"騷動；強烈抗議","s":"There was an ________ when the school banned phones completely, so the principal agreed to discuss the rule with students.","zh":"學校全面禁止手機時引起了一片譁然，所以校長同意和學生討論這項規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"一片譁然"},{"w":"veracity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being true","cn":"真實性","s":"Reporters questioned the ________ of the photo, because the shadows did not match the time of day.","zh":"記者質疑那張照片的真實性，因為陰影和當時的時間對不上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"真實性"},{"w":"intent","pos":"n.","def":"what someone plans to do","cn":"意圖；目的","s":"The ________ of the fake account was to make people distrust the election, so the platform deleted it quickly.","zh":"那個假帳號的意圖是讓人們不信任選舉，所以平台很快就把它刪除了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"意圖"},{"w":"misstep","pos":"n.","def":"a mistake in action or judgement","cn":"失策；失誤","s":"Posting the joke was a serious ________ for the brand, and it lost thousands of followers in one day.","zh":"發布那個笑話是該品牌的嚴重失策，它一天內就失去了數千名追蹤者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"失策"},{"w":"plurality","pos":"n.","def":"a large number of different things","cn":"多元；多數","s":"A healthy democracy needs a ________ of voices, so it is important that small newspapers can survive too.","zh":"健全的民主需要多元的聲音，所以讓小型報社也能生存下去很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"多元"},{"w":"slur","pos":"n.","def":"an insulting remark about someone","cn":"誹謗；侮辱性言語","s":"The fan shouted a racist ________ at the player, and the club banned him from the stadium for life.","zh":"那位球迷對球員大喊種族歧視的侮辱性言語，球團終身禁止他進入球場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"侮辱性言語"},{"w":"testimony","pos":"n.","def":"a formal statement about what someone saw or knows","cn":"證詞","s":"The witness's ________ was very clear, so the jury believed her rather than the man's online supporters.","zh":"那位證人的證詞非常清楚，所以陪審團相信她，而不是那名男子的網路支持者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"證詞"},{"w":"ethos","pos":"n.","def":"the set of beliefs and values of a group","cn":"精神；風氣；價值觀","s":"The ________ of the newspaper is to tell the truth without fear, so it often publishes stories that powerful people dislike.","zh":"那家報社的精神是無畏地說出真相，所以它常刊登有權勢者不喜歡的報導。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"精神"},{"w":"folly","pos":"n.","def":"a foolish action or idea","cn":"愚蠢；愚行","s":"It would be ________ to believe every message in the family group chat, because many of them are forwarded without checking.","zh":"相信家族群組裡的每一則訊息是很愚蠢的，因為許多訊息都是未經查證就轉傳的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"愚蠢"},{"w":"impunity","pos":"n.","def":"freedom from punishment","cn":"不受懲罰","s":"Online trolls often act with ________, because they hide behind fake names and are rarely caught.","zh":"網路酸民常常肆無忌憚，因為他們躲在假名後面，很少被抓到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"肆無忌憚"},{"w":"mantra","pos":"n.","def":"a phrase repeated often as a belief or rule","cn":"口頭禪；信條","s":"\"Check before you share\" has become the ________ of our school's media club, and members repeat it at every meeting.","zh":"「分享前先查證」已成為我們學校媒體社的信條，社員們每次聚會都會複述。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"信條"},{"w":"mockery","pos":"n.","def":"laughing at someone in an unkind way","cn":"嘲弄；嘲笑","s":"The boy's funny accent became the object of ________ online, so his parents asked the website to remove the video.","zh":"那男孩有趣的口音在網路上成了嘲笑的對象，所以他父母要求網站移除影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"嘲笑"},{"w":"onslaught","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong attack or a huge amount of something","cn":"猛烈攻擊；大量湧現","s":"The actress faced an ________ of hateful comments after the film, so she took a break from social media.","zh":"電影上映後，那位女演員遭到仇恨留言的猛烈攻擊，所以她暫時停用社群媒體。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"猛烈攻擊"},{"w":"taboo","pos":"n.","def":"a subject people avoid talking about","cn":"禁忌","s":"Mental health used to be a ________ in many families, but now more young people talk about it openly online.","zh":"心理健康過去在許多家庭中是禁忌，但現在越來越多年輕人在網路上公開談論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"禁忌"},{"w":"trepidation","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of fear about something that may happen","cn":"惶恐；憂慮","s":"She opened the comments under her first video with ________, but most of them were kind and encouraging.","zh":"她忐忑不安地打開第一支影片下的留言，但大部分都很友善又鼓勵人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"忐忑不安地"},{"w":"vantage point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a position from which you can see or understand something well","cn":"有利位置；觀點","s":"From the ______ ______ of a small-town reporter, the national news often misses what really matters to local people.","zh":"從一位小鎮記者的角度來看，全國新聞常常忽略了對當地人真正重要的事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"角度"},{"w":"purportedly","pos":"adv.","def":"according to what is claimed, but possibly not true","cn":"據稱；據說","s":"The video ________ shows a UFO over Taipei, but experts believe it is simply a lantern from a festival.","zh":"那段影片據稱拍到台北上空的幽浮，但專家認為那只是節慶放的天燈。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"據稱"},{"w":"unwittingly","pos":"adv.","def":"without knowing or intending","cn":"不知不覺地；無意中","s":"Many people ________ spread false news, because they share posts from friends without thinking to check them.","zh":"許多人不知不覺地散播假新聞，因為他們分享朋友的貼文時沒想到要查證。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"不知不覺地"},{"w":"ironically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is the opposite of what you expect","cn":"諷刺的是；反諷地","s":"________, the talk about the dangers of phones was interrupted when the speaker's own phone started ringing.","zh":"諷刺的是，那場談手機危害的講座因講者自己的手機響起而被打斷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"諷刺的是"},{"w":"needlessly","pos":"adv.","def":"without any good reason","cn":"不必要地；無謂地","s":"The headline ________ frightened parents, because the article said the risk to children was actually very low.","zh":"那個標題不必要地嚇壞了家長，因為文章說兒童的風險其實很低。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"不必要地"},{"w":"publicly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that everyone can see or hear","cn":"公開地","s":"The company ________ apologised for the misleading advert, and it promised to give customers their money back.","zh":"那家公司公開為誤導性廣告道歉，並承諾退款給顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"公開"},{"w":"wrongly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a mistaken or unfair way","cn":"錯誤地；冤枉地","s":"The man was ________ named as the thief on social media, so he received threats even though he was innocent.","zh":"那名男子在社群媒體上被誤指為小偷，所以即使他是無辜的，他仍收到威脅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"誤指"},{"w":"falsely","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is not true","cn":"虛假地；不實地","s":"The website ________ claimed that the drink could prevent the flu, so the government ordered it to remove the advert.","zh":"那個網站不實地聲稱那款飲料可以預防流感，所以政府命令它撤下廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"不實地"},{"w":"openly","pos":"adv.","def":"without hiding anything","cn":"公開地；坦白地","s":"The athlete spoke ________ about her anxiety in an interview, and many fans thanked her for being so honest.","zh":"那位運動員在訪問中坦率地談論她的焦慮，許多粉絲感謝她如此誠實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"坦率地"},{"w":"understandably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is easy to understand","cn":"可以理解地","s":"The villagers were ________ angry about the false report, because it had frightened tourists away from their town.","zh":"村民們對那則不實報導感到憤怒是可以理解的，因為它把遊客嚇得不敢來他們的小鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"可以理解的"},{"w":"verbatim","pos":"adv.","def":"using exactly the same words","cn":"一字不差地；逐字地","s":"The student copied the article ________ into his essay, so the teacher noticed immediately that it was not his own work.","zh":"那位學生把文章一字不差地抄進他的作文，所以老師立刻注意到那不是他自己寫的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"一字不差地"},{"w":"go viral","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to spread very quickly online","cn":"爆紅；瘋傳","s":"Her video of the rescue ______ ______ within hours, and soon TV stations from other countries wanted to interview her.","zh":"她的救援影片在幾小時內就爆紅，很快其他國家的電視台都想採訪她。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"爆紅"},{"w":"spread like wildfire","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to spread very quickly","cn":"迅速蔓延；像野火般傳開","s":"The rumour about the exam ______ ______ ______, so by lunchtime every student in the school was talking about it.","zh":"關於考試的謠言像野火般迅速傳開，所以到了午餐時間，全校每個學生都在談論它。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"像野火般迅速傳開"},{"w":"with a pinch of salt","pos":"phr.","def":"with some doubt, not believing everything","cn":"半信半疑地；有所保留地","s":"You should take celebrity diet tips ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because most stars have personal trainers and chefs.","zh":"你應該對名人的減肥秘訣持保留態度，因為大多數明星都有私人教練和廚師。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"持保留態度"},{"w":"hit the headlines","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become important news everywhere","cn":"登上頭條；成為新聞焦點","s":"The small village ______ ______ ______ when a student found a rare fossil, and tourists began to visit every weekend.","zh":"一名學生發現了一塊罕見化石後，那個小村莊登上了頭條，遊客開始每個週末都來參觀。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"登上了頭條"},{"w":"off the record","pos":"phr.","def":"said privately, not to be published","cn":"私下說的；不得公開的","s":"The official spoke ______ ______ ______, so the reporter could use the information but could not print his name.","zh":"那位官員是私下透露的，所以記者可以使用這些資訊，但不能刊出他的名字。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"私下透露"},{"w":"word of mouth","pos":"n.phr.","def":"information passed from person to person by talking","cn":"口耳相傳；口碑","s":"The small café never advertised, but ______ ______ ______ brought so many customers that there is always a queue.","zh":"那家小咖啡店從不打廣告，但口碑帶來了大量顧客，所以門口總是大排長龍。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"口碑"},{"w":"behind closed doors","pos":"phr.","def":"in private, without the public knowing","cn":"私下；閉門","s":"The decision was made ______ ______ ______, so the public only learned about it after the new rules started.","zh":"那項決定是閉門做出的，所以大眾直到新規定開始實施後才得知。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"閉門"},{"w":"get the message across","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make people understand what you mean","cn":"把意思傳達清楚","s":"The poster used simple pictures to ______ ______ ______ ______, because many of the visitors could not read Chinese.","zh":"那張海報使用簡單的圖片來把訊息傳達清楚，因為許多遊客看不懂中文。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"把訊息傳達清楚"},{"w":"beat around the bush","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to avoid talking about the main topic","cn":"拐彎抹角；說話繞圈子","s":"Please stop ______ ______ ______ ______ and tell me what happened, because I am really worried about you.","zh":"請不要再拐彎抹角了，直接告訴我發生了什麼事，因為我真的很擔心你。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"拐彎抹角"},{"w":"read the room","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to understand how people around you feel","cn":"察言觀色；看場合","s":"The comedian failed to ______ ______ ______, so he told jokes at a sad event and many guests were offended.","zh":"那位喜劇演員沒能察言觀色，所以他在一個哀傷的場合講笑話，許多賓客都覺得被冒犯。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"察言觀色"},{"w":"lost in translation","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"losing meaning when changed into another language","cn":"在翻譯中失去原意","s":"The joke was very funny in Japanese, but most of it was ______ ______ ______, so the English audience did not laugh.","zh":"那個笑話在日文裡非常好笑，但大部分在翻譯中失去了原意，所以英語觀眾沒有笑。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"在翻譯中失去了原意"},{"w":"the elephant in the room","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an obvious problem that nobody wants to talk about","cn":"大家避而不談的明顯問題","s":"Everyone discussed the new logo, but nobody mentioned ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, which was the company's falling sales.","zh":"大家都在討論新標誌，卻沒有人提到那個明擺著卻沒人敢談的問題，也就是公司銷售額下滑。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"那個明擺著卻沒人敢談的問題"},{"w":"in a nutshell","pos":"phr.","def":"in a few words; briefly","cn":"簡而言之；總之","s":"______ ______ ______, the report says that most teenagers trust videos more than newspapers, and this worries many teachers.","zh":"簡而言之，那份報告說大多數青少年相信影片勝過報紙，而這讓許多老師感到擔憂。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"簡而言之"},{"w":"through the grapevine","pos":"phr.","def":"through informal talk between people","cn":"透過小道消息；輾轉聽說","s":"I heard ______ ______ ______ that our teacher is leaving, but I am not sure whether it is true.","zh":"我透過小道消息聽說我們老師要離職了，但我不確定是不是真的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"小道消息"},{"w":"spill the beans","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to tell a secret too early","cn":"洩露秘密","s":"We planned a surprise party for Mum, but my little brother ______ ______ ______ at breakfast, so she knew everything.","zh":"我們為媽媽策劃了一場驚喜派對，但我弟弟在早餐時洩露了秘密，所以她全都知道了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"洩露了秘密"},{"w":"twist one's words","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to change the meaning of what someone said","cn":"扭曲某人的話","s":"The reporter ______ ______ ______, because I said the plan had problems, not that it was a complete failure.","zh":"那位記者扭曲了我的話，因為我說的是那個計畫有問題，不是說它徹底失敗。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"扭曲了我的話"},{"w":"out of context","pos":"phr.","def":"separated from the situation that explains its meaning","cn":"斷章取義；脫離上下文","s":"The clip took her comment ______ ______ ______, so it sounded rude, although she was actually making a joke.","zh":"那段短片把她的評論斷章取義，所以聽起來很無禮，儘管她其實是在開玩笑。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"斷章取義"},{"w":"set the record straight","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to correct a false story","cn":"澄清事實；以正視聽","s":"The singer posted a video to ______ ______ ______ ______, because many fans believed the false rumours about her marriage.","zh":"那位歌手發布了一支影片來澄清事實，因為許多粉絲相信了關於她婚姻的不實謠言。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"澄清事實"},{"w":"speak one's mind","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to say honestly what you think","cn":"說出心裡話；直言","s":"Our teacher encourages us to ______ ______ ______ in class discussions, but she also asks us to respect other people's views.","zh":"老師鼓勵我們在課堂討論中說出自己的想法，但她也要求我們尊重別人的觀點。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"說出自己的想法"},{"w":"on the same page","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"agreeing about what to do","cn":"看法一致；有共識","s":"Before the interview, the team met to make sure everyone was ______ ______ ______ ______, so nobody gave different answers.","zh":"採訪前團隊開了會，確保大家有共識，這樣就不會有人給出不同的答案。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"有共識"}]};
